(604, 120, 'GVC Camp Leaflets', 'Glisen Group', 1, 2, 'These GVC Camp leaflets are patient education materials distributed during diabetes camps to help patients understand their condition and improve awareness.\r\n\r\nWe would like to redesign the current artwork by replacing the  How to Use Glucometer section with the Indian Diabetes Risk Score (IDRS) component. This change will help us emphasize risk assessment and early identification during camps.\r\n\r\nThe objective is to make the leaflet more screening-focused, enabling patients to assess their diabetes risk score on the spot and encouraging early medical consultation.\r\n\r\nKindly redesign the artwork accordingly while keeping the layout simple, engaging, and easy for patients to understand.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-02-25 07:05:07', '', '2026-02-25 07:05:07', '2026-02-26 05:42:08'),
(605, 78, 'Etrik 22Yrs Birthday celebration', 'Etrik', 4, 22, 'This Project is regarding 22nd Birthday celebration of Etrik . Here we are going to create an interactive animation for doctor in I-PAD. The concept is already briefed to web / video Team \r\nThis Project is regarding 22nd Birthday celebration of Etrik . Here we are going to create an interactive animation for doctor in I-PAD. The concept is already briefed to web / video Team \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'in_progress', '2026-02-25 07:21:58', '', '2026-02-25 07:21:58', '2026-03-11 18:31:00'),
(606, 126, 'Wikoryl 325DT VA page', 'Wikoryl 325DT', 1, 1, 'I have shared the current page of Wikoryl 325DT for modification. Please try to keep the layout the same as the Wikoryl 10 VA pages. Also, improve the depiction of tablet disintegration so that it clearly shows the process happening and resembles the USP standard. Additionally, please change the pack shot as shared in the email.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-25 07:58:33', '', '2026-02-25 07:58:33', '2026-03-12 08:44:20'),
(607, 120, 'Excelarate 2027 Cardigem Anthem ', 'Glisen Group, Tellzy H/AH, Rosave Gold and Tufehar', 2, 11, 'To create a high-energy, professional, and motivational sales anthem that inspires the field force to take ownership of performance, accelerate execution, and deliver consistent growth in FY27.\r\n\r\nThe anthem should ignite pride, confidence, and winning mindset without sounding dramatic or Bollywood-style. It must feel corporate, sharp, modern, and performance-driven.\r\nCorporate sports anthem + leadership summit energy', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-25 08:02:21', '', '2026-02-25 08:02:21', '2026-03-05 10:51:08'),
(608, 84, 'Rosave F VA', 'Rosave F', 1, 1, 'This is a 3 pager VA for Rosave F, all the pages are changed as compared to the previous VA.\r\nFirst Page is theme page wherein we want to emphasize that Indian Diabetes patients have high risk of dyslipidemia\r\nSecond Page is brand benefit page\r\nThird Page is more focused on brand differentiation compared to the competitor', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'assigned', '2026-02-25 08:07:15', '', '2026-02-25 08:07:15', '2026-03-09 10:09:36'),
(609, 171, 'UCPMP Compliance training module', 'ALL', 2, 11, 'UCPMP Compliance train module UCPMP Compliance train module UCPMP Compliance train module UCPMP Compliance train module UCPMP Compliance train module UCPMP Compliance train module UCPMP Compliance train module UCPMP Compliance train module UCPMP Compliance train module UCPMP Compliance train module UCPMP Compliance train module UCPMP Compliance train module UCPMP Compliance train module', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'in_progress', '2026-02-25 09:59:46', '', '2026-02-25 09:59:46', '2026-03-01 18:31:00'),
(610, 172, 'DSP LBL APRIL', 'Donance S Pro', 1, 1, 'Front back LBL, in continuation to the earlier LBL series. The theme is on powerful reduction of sugar\r\nUse icons against each bullet point where the arrow is marked\r\nFront back LBL, in continuation to the earlier LBL series. The theme is on powerful reduction of sugar\r\nUse icons against each bullet point where the arrow is marked\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-25 10:05:39', '', '2026-02-25 10:05:39', '2026-02-26 10:13:43'),
(611, 172, 'TETAN LBL APRIL', 'TETAN', 1, 1, 'Same like previous LBLs, with patient profile of indian patient between 50-60 years of age \r\nFront back LBL. One side all brands and the next side scientific content. Add icons where image is mentioned\r\n\r\nSame like previous LBLs, with patient profile of indian patient between 50-60 years of age \r\nFront back LBL. One side all brands and the next side scientific content. Add icons where image is mentioned', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-25 10:30:13', '', '2026-02-25 10:30:13', '2026-03-04 10:55:53'),
(612, 136, 'HAPPY DAY LOGO STICKER & CARICATURE', 'Tellzy Grp', 1, 4, 'As part of our Happiness Theme Campaign, we would like to develop a creative “HAPPY DAY” logo sticker and caricature design aligned with the positive and energetic spirit of the initiative. the concept should incorporate a happy emoji or an artistic representation of happiness, maintaining a vibrant yet premium appeal that resonates well with the Tellzy brand personality\r\n\r\nWe request you to kindly share three creative design options that reflect:\r\nPositivity and joy\r\nEnergy and confidence\r\n\r\nAlignment with our brand philosophy\r\nThe design should be suitable for use as a sticker, standee, digital creatives, and campaign materials', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'pending', '2026-02-25 10:58:47', '', '2026-02-25 10:58:47', '2026-02-25 10:58:47'),
