(614, 34, 'Design Resync Plus - Brand reminder card as well as Chemist Availability Card', 'Resync Plus', 1, 1, 'Develop two high-impact A5 size creative collaterals to support the launch and recall of the Resync portfolio, with special focus on the new Resync Plus. The first will be a Brand Reminder Card (A5) designed for doctor chambers and MR detailing folders. This card should prominently showcase the complete Resync range – Resync (0.1%), Resync Plus (0.18%), and Resync Ultra (0.3%) – in a single, visually layout. \r\n\r\nThe second will be a Chemist Availability Card (A5) focused primarily on Resync Plus. This card will be placed at retail counters to create strong visibility and ensure chemist recall and substitution confidence.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-25 14:53:34', '', '2026-02-25 14:53:34', '2026-03-10 04:50:21'),
(615, 69, 'Rosacea Awareness Month Digital Flyers Apr\'26', 'Oryza Sensitive', 1, 1, 'Create a series of four premium digital flyers to be shared weekly during Rosacea Awareness Month. Each flyer will highlight key facts about rosacea, including prevalence, triggers, barrier dysfunction, and the importance of gentle moisturization. The objective is to educate dermatologists while positioning Oryza Sensitive as a clinically aligned, barrier-supportive solution for rosacea-prone skin through scientific, credible, and impactful communication.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'pending', '2026-02-26 03:28:44', '', '2026-02-26 03:28:44', '2026-02-26 03:28:44'),
(616, 69, 'Oryza Sensitive Digital Reminders', 'Oryza Sensitive', 1, 1, 'Create a set of 8 premium digital flyers highlighting one unique benefit of Oryza Sensitive in each creative. These flyers will be shared by BMs with dermatologists via WhatsApp as structured digital reminders. The objective is to reinforce key product advantages consistently, strengthen scientific recall, and improve brand retention through short, focused, high-impact communication tailored for quick mobile viewing.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'accepted', '2026-02-26 04:24:43', '', '2026-02-26 04:24:43', '2026-03-04 10:04:34'),
(620, 36, 'Crina-NCR 100 Cr video', 'Crina-NCR', 2, 10, 'Crina-NCR will cross 100 cr by May \'26.  I want to create a video to show that the counting starts. As of now we stand at 97 Cr. I want a video with a countdown to 100 Cr and then the celebration. Also its the 5th brand in Alembic going to cross 100 Cr', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'assigned', '2026-02-26 05:37:47', '', '2026-02-26 05:37:47', '2026-03-09 10:28:28'),
(621, 67, 'International Womens Day Flyer', 'Glisen SM, Glisen MF, Tellzy H , Rosave Gold ', 1, 2, 'Kindly design a flyer on occasion of International Womens Day, The poster should have date in the format 8th March, kindly refrain from using dark colour background which will hamper the brand visibility. The poster should have the logo of Alembic in the top right corner and towards the bottom it should have all the 4 brand names i.e Glisen SM, Glisen MF, Tellzy H and Rosave Gold  and above the brand name mention the line  \"From the marketers of\".Keep the design simple and neat.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-26 05:45:12', '', '2026-02-26 05:45:12', '2026-03-05 12:18:09'),
(622, 67, 'Mahavir Jayanti Flyer', 'Glisen SM, Glisen MF, Tellzy H , Rosave Gold ', 1, 2, 'Kindly design a flyer on occasion of Mahavir Jayanti, \r\nThe poster should have date in the format 31st March, kindly refrain from using dark colour background which will hamper the brand visibility. The poster should have the logo of Alembic in the top right corner and towards the bottom it should have all the 4 brand names i.e (Glisen SM, Glisen MF, Tellzy H and Rosave Gold)  and above the brand name mention the line  \"From the marketers of\". \r\n\r\nPlease Note: Keep the design simple and neat.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'in_progress', '2026-02-26 06:00:42', '', '2026-02-26 06:00:42', '2026-03-22 18:31:00'),
(623, 97, 'Poster, Tent card design', 'Geripod-D', 1, 2, 'Badge, Poster to be of A4 size, Tent  card of A3 size. It is used for BPH screening camp which is a primary test done for screening. \r\nThe content of Poster & Tent card to be same, just a size difference. Refer the ppt attached for better understanding.\r\nImage: Use image of a man more than 50yrs, tensed looking around toilet & symptoms rolling around.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Others\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-26 06:03:29', '', '2026-02-26 06:03:29', '2026-03-18 07:37:29'),
(624, 151, 'North East LBL', 'Resync', 1, 1, 'Leave-Behind Literature (LBL) refers to printed or digital materials given to respondents after completing a survey. Its purpose is to reinforce key messages, provide additional information,  encourage future engagement.\r\n\r\n Primary Goals\r\n\r\nReinforce survey findings or key points\r\n\r\nProvide educational or supporting content\r\n\r\nBuild credibility and trust\r\n\r\nEncourage further action or participation\r\n\r\nSummaries of survey insights — quick highlights of results\r\n\r\nBrochures or fact sheets — in-depth info on topics covered\r\n\r\n✅ Keep language simple and relevant\r\n✅ Use visuals (charts, icons, infographics)\r\n✅ Highlight key takeaways only\r\n✅ Include clear contact/action info\r\n✅ Match design to brand or survey tone', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'low', 'in_progress', '2026-02-26 06:06:12', '', '2026-02-26 06:06:12', '2026-03-09 18:31:00'),
(625, 151, 'South West LBL', 'Resync', 1, 1, 'Leave-Behind Literature (LBL) refers to printed or digital materials given to respondents after completing a survey. Its purpose is to reinforce key messages, provide additional information,  encourage future engagement.\r\n\r\n Primary Goals\r\n\r\nReinforce survey findings or key points\r\n\r\nProvide educational or supporting content\r\n\r\nBuild credibility and trust\r\n\r\nEncourage further action or participation\r\n\r\nSummaries of survey insights — quick highlights of results\r\n\r\nBrochures or fact sheets — in-depth info on topics covered\r\n\r\n✅ Keep language simple and relevant\r\n✅ Use visuals (charts, icons, infographics)\r\n✅ Highlight key takeaways only\r\n✅ Include clear contact/action info\r\n✅ Match design to brand or survey tone', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-02-26 06:07:23', '', '2026-02-26 06:07:23', '2026-02-26 14:22:48'),
(626, 67, 'Ram Navami Flyer', 'Glisen SM, Glisen MF, Tellzy H , Rosave Gold ', 1, 2, 'Kindly design a flyer on occasion of Ram Navami, \r\n\r\nThe poster should have date in the format 26th March, kindly refrain from using dark colour background which will hamper the brand visibility. The poster should have the logo of Alembic in the top right corner and towards the bottom it should have all the 4 brand names i.e Glisen SM, Glisen MF, Tellzy H and Rosave Gold  and above the brand name mention the line  \"From the marketers of\".\r\n\r\nPlease note: Keep the design simple and neat.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-26 06:08:41', '', '2026-02-26 06:08:41', '2026-03-24 06:42:16'),
(627, 168, 'Bladmir LBL-Apr\'26', 'Bladmir, Bladmir-S', 1, 1, 'Design an A4 vertical LBL for BLADMIR with a premium, clean, and clinically strong look. The top section should carry an emotional yet professional headline highlighting storage symptoms frequency, supported by a subtle patient visual reflecting. and a simple graph or icon-based depiction of symptom improvement. The lower section must highlight BLADMIR’s core benefits—effective storage symptom. Use calming blue/green tones, adequate white space, and ensure strong brand visibility', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-26 06:19:09', '', '2026-02-26 06:19:09', '2026-03-09 07:40:19'),
(628, 99, 'Estrofit HMTBa Video', 'Estrofit Bolus', 2, 11, 'Pathway of HMTBa Molecule  \r\nMouth:- HMTBa  molecule will goes inside the mouth.\r\nRumen:- Zoom the Rumen then show this HMTBa Molecule is stable in rumen\r\nReticulam:- HMTBa Molecule will travel normally from reticulam \r\nOmasum:- HMTBa Molecule will travel normally from reticulam \r\nAbomasum:- Zoom the Abomasum then show this HMTBAa Molecule is abomasum ( stable upto 2.5 pH)\r\nSmall Intestine:- Zoom the Small intestine & this HMTBa molecule goes very near to receptors and release the Cu, Zn, Mn in to the receptors. HMTBa Molecule will dissolve in Intestine  \r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\",\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'assigned', '2026-02-26 06:40:03', '', '2026-02-26 06:40:03', '2026-03-04 06:50:50'),
(629, 124, 'DONANCE LBL - APRIL\'26', 'DONANCE - M', 1, 1, 'Design a clean, professional label for DONANCE that reflects trust and efficacy. Use a modern layout with clear brand visibility, balanced color palette, and strong typography. Highlight key product benefits subtly. Ensure readability, medical credibility, and premium appeal while aligning with pharmaceutical compliance and brand identity guidelines.\r\nDESIGN PATIENT PROFILER', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-26 06:42:56', '', '2026-02-26 06:42:56', '2026-02-27 05:53:58'),
(630, 151, 'Veldrop iPad video', 'Veldrop', 2, 10, 'Project Title:\r\niPad Product Highlight Video\r\n\r\nObjective:\r\nShowcase the iPad’s key features in a clean, modern, and engaging way to drive interest and sales.\r\n\r\nTarget Audience:\r\nStudents, creatives, and professionals looking for portability and performance.\r\n\r\nKey Messages:\r\n\r\nPowerful performance\r\n\r\nSleek and lightweight design\r\n\r\nApple Pencil & keyboard compatibility\r\n\r\nAll-day battery life\r\n\r\nPerfect for work, study, and creativity\r\n\r\nTone & Style:\r\nMinimal, premium, bright lighting, smooth transitions.\r\n\r\nDuration:\r\n30 seconds\r\n\r\nPlatform:\r\niPad, VA\r\n\r\n\r\n“Upgrade your everyday with iPad.”\r\n\r\nProlonged use of digital devices may lead to digital eye strain causing ocular discomfort & tear film instability\r\n\r\nFollowing TFOS DEWS 3 Guidelines ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-02-26 06:53:14', '', '2026-02-26 06:53:14', '2026-03-16 10:09:33'),
(631, 100, 'Zenovi March Festive artwork', 'Ovigyn Q10', 1, 1, 'Dear Team,\r\n\r\nWe are planning to highlight the Festive Days of March and would like to create a vibrant and engaging festive artwork for the same.\r\n\r\nKindly design a creative artwork that reflects the festive spirit, positivity, and togetherness of the month. The design should be colorful, energetic, and aligned with our brand guidelines.\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'medium', 'pending', '2026-02-26 07:02:55', '', '2026-02-26 07:02:55', '2026-02-26 07:02:55'),
(632, 97, 'Geripod-D LBL', 'Geripod-D', 1, 1, 'Design LBL for Geripod-D emphasizing more on the Tag line -Live Life Uninterrupted. Old man aged 50+yrs.\r\nPlease refer the ppt shared, it a full day activity showing life get interrupted at each stage. \r\nBig 24-hour circular clock\r\nDivide into 4 time zones:\r\n12 Noon – Office meeting disrupted\r\n3 PM – Avoiding travel\r\n9 PM – Dinner disturbed\r\n2 AM – Nocturia breaks sleep\r\nUse small red “pause” symbols at each time.\r\n ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-26 07:03:42', '', '2026-02-26 07:03:42', '2026-03-10 06:07:25'),
(633, 100, 'Zenovi division March Festive content ', 'Ovigyn Q10', 3, 16, 'Dear Team,\r\n\r\nWe are planning to highlight the Festive Days of March and would like to create a vibrant and engaging festive content for the same.\r\n\r\nKindly provide content for  artwork that reflects the festive spirit, positivity, and togetherness of the month. The design should be colorful, energetic, and aligned with our brand guidelines.\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\",\"Chemists\",\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-26 07:07:14', '', '2026-02-26 07:07:14', '2026-03-24 10:36:53'),
(634, 122, 'Annual Meet Video', 'Azithral, Wikoryl, Brozeet LS, Rekool, Ulgel, Lave', 2, 11, 'Annual Meet Video,Script will be shared, Video need to be prepared.Annual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet VideoAnnual Meet Video', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-26 07:31:25', '', '2026-02-26 07:31:25', '2026-03-20 05:50:56'),
(635, 124, 'Pharma VA pages animation', 'VILDAMBIC, DONANCE, CLOFF OL, ROXID ', 2, 10, 'We request the development of engaging VA page animations to enhance communication effectiveness during doctor interactions. The animations should be clean, professional, and aligned with brand guidelines, highlighting key messages step-by-step. Focus on smooth transitions, clear storytelling, and strong visual appeal to simplify complex information and improve recall value. Ensure compatibility with standard presentation tools.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-26 07:34:05', '', '2026-02-26 07:34:05', '2026-03-16 05:39:15'),
(636, 34, 'Resync Plus - Launch video teaser content', 'Resync Plus', 3, 15, '✅ BALANCE\r\nWhy this works perfectly for Resync Plus:\r\nMid-strength SH (0.18%) → Balance between 0.1% and 0.3%\r\nIonic buffer → pH & tear film osmolarity balance\r\nTrehalose → Cellular stress balance\r\nBrand logic: Resync Plus = Balanced hydration + protection kindly helop with the teaser video script please update', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'assigned', '2026-02-26 08:12:10', '', '2026-02-26 08:12:10', '2026-03-16 10:17:50'),
(637, 34, 'Resync Plus Launch teaser video', 'Resync Plus', 2, 11, '✅ BALANCE\r\nWhy this works perfectly for Resync Plus:\r\nMid-strength SH (0.18%) → Balance between 0.1% and 0.3%\r\nIonic buffer → pH & tear film osmolarity balance\r\nTrehalose → Cellular stress balance\r\nBrand logic: Resync Plus = Balanced hydration + protection kindly helop with the teaser video script please update', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-26 08:13:10', '', '2026-02-26 08:13:10', '2026-03-25 03:12:32'),
(638, 151, 'Veldrop iPad video', 'Veldrop', 3, 16, 'Require a video script that highlights Veldrop\'s role in dry eye management. The script should be written such that it results into a video of not more than 30 seconds. The structure can be as follows: start with the problem statement and causes followed by the role of brand in helping treat the eye disorder. Important highlights of the script can also include the key molecules that help treat dry eyes. Additionally, it is important to mention that Veldrop formulation follows the Tfos DEWS 3 guidelines. the script needs to be concluded with a common writeup: Veldrop goes beyond lubrication ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-26 08:13:43', '', '2026-02-26 08:13:43', '2026-02-27 12:05:24'),
(639, 60, 'New Livfit 3 SKU Packshot images', 'New Livfit', 5, 31, 'As discussed with Vikram Rai, I will be requiring the Packshot images of the 3 SKUs of New Livfit. New Livfit Syrup 200 ml, New Livfit Tablet 10 tabs, New Livfit Drop 60 ml. The Specifications for the same will be mailed to you. Request to please close this opn priority\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nSumeet Paradkar\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-26 09:04:07', '', '2026-02-26 09:04:07', '2026-02-27 09:52:25'),
(640, 60, 'Roxid VA Pages', 'Roxid', 5, 31, 'Request to please convert the VA Pages for Roxid in Proper PDF format. These VA pages are required to be incorporated in the I PAD for detailing purpose. This has to be given to the Photo Team of the Digilabs for further work. Request to please Close this on priority.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'accepted', '2026-02-26 09:14:10', '', '2026-02-26 09:14:10', '2026-03-11 08:31:00'),
(641, 139, 'Gujarati Language Glaucoma Awareness Poster ', 'Antiglaucoma Brands', 1, 2, 'Design two clinic-display posters using the provided Gujarati content for public awareness. The artwork should be clean, easy to read, and patient-friendly with clear visual hierarchy. Use ophthalmology-relevant imagery, soft medical colours, and large Gujarati typography suitable for waiting areas or handouts, ensuring educational clarity and professional healthcare appeal. This will be printed in A3 size posters ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Others\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-26 10:08:13', '', '2026-02-26 10:08:13', '2026-03-05 12:24:34'),
(642, 105, 'AWARENESS AND CELEBRATION DAYS - MARCH 2026', 'VELDROP TRAVISIGHT RESYNC', 3, 16, 'This project involves creating festive and awareness-based digital flyers and GIFs for key March occasions—Holi (3rd March), Women’s Day (8th March), World Sleep Day (13th March), World Optometry Day (23rd March), Ram Navami (27th March), and Mahavir Jayanti (31st March). The objective is to engage ophthalmology stakeholders through meaningful, brand-aligned communication and strengthen brand connection within the eyecare community.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-26 10:52:12', '', '2026-02-26 10:52:12', '2026-03-09 09:54:05'),
(643, 105, 'AWARENESS AND CELEBRATION DAYS - MARCH 2026', 'VELDROP TRAVISIGHT RESYNC', 1, 2, 'This project involves creating festive and awareness-based digital flyers and GIFs for key March occasions—Holi (3rd March), Women’s Day (8th March), World Sleep Day (13th March), World Optometry Day (23rd March), Ram Navami (27th March), and Mahavir Jayanti (31st March). The objective is to engage ophthalmology stakeholders through meaningful, brand-aligned communication and strengthen brand connection within the eyecare community.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\",\"iPad 10\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'assigned', '2026-02-26 10:53:17', '', '2026-02-26 10:53:17', '2026-02-26 11:47:47'),
(644, 139, 'Adjunctive Therapy  Concept Page', 'Travisight + Brinzemic- B', 1, 1, 'Create a simple visual showing two medicines working together to control eye pressure better than one medicine alone.\r\nShow:\r\nOne treatment giving partial control.\r\nTwo treatments combining and giving stronger, stable control to the eye.\r\nKeep the design clean, easy to understand, medical, and eye-focused so field teams can explain the concept quickly to doctors. Use brand colours and a professional pharmaceutical look.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-26 11:41:45', '', '2026-02-26 11:41:45', '2026-03-11 12:20:08'),
(645, 168, 'Geripod-M LBL-Apr\'26', 'Geripod-M', 1, 1, 'Design an A4 vertical Leave Behind Literature (LBL) for GERIPOD-M with a premium, clean, and clinically strong look. The top section should carry an emotional yet professional headline highlighting storage symptoms in BPH (urgency, frequency, nocturia), supported by a subtle patient visual reflecting life interruption. The middle section should clearly present key clinical insights, prevalence of OAB overlap in BPH, and a simple graph or icon-based depiction of symptom improvement. Use calming Brand colors, adequate white space, and ensure strong brand visibility with a confident closing tagline like “Relieve Storage Symptoms to Re LIVE Life.”', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-26 11:53:03', '', '2026-02-26 11:53:03', '2026-03-06 09:43:23'),
(646, 122, 'Slab Artwork', 'Azithral, Wikoryl, Brozeet LS, Rekool, Ulgel, Lave', 1, 2, 'Retailer Slab Artwork as per the PPT attached.Retailer Slab Artwork as per the PPT attached.Retailer Slab Artwork as per the PPT attached.Retailer Slab Artwork as per the PPT attached.Retailer Slab Artwork as per the PPT attached.Retailer Slab Artwork as per the PPT attached.Retailer Slab Artwork as per the PPT attached.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-26 17:22:05', '', '2026-02-26 17:22:05', '2026-03-02 04:25:43'),
(647, 63, 'Messages for MRs', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'We can make creative visuals etc for information to field. \r\n \r\n1.	Productive calls expand prescriber base—expanded base drives sustainable Rx growth and primary sales.\r\n2.	Prioritized targeting + productive calls = predictable sales growth.\r\n3.	Convert interactions into prescribers, and prescribers into consistent Rx flow.\r\n4.	Higher call quality improves conversion, accelerating primary and secondary sales momentum.\r\n5.	Strategic detailing today builds prescription loyalty for tomorrow.\r\n6.	Every focused call strengthens coverage, frequency, and sales impact.\r\n7.	Scientific, need-based calls translate into measurable sales outcomes.\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-27 03:47:14', '', '2026-02-27 03:47:14', '2026-03-11 07:04:32'),
(648, 63, 'Women\'s Day Internal Spotlight', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'The women leaders will be featured in an internal campaign for the upcoming International Women\'s Day 2026. Managers have been identified who will talk about their journey at Alembic and how they feel seen, heard and supported in the organization. Spotlight- Her Story. Her Rise. Our Culture With Her.\r\nOR\r\nCelebrate Her Journey. Honour Her Voice. Support Her Rise\r\n\r\n1) Static Post\r\n\r\nLook at her: her courage, her growth, her leadership.\r\n\r\nOur culture made space for her to shine\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 9\",\"iPad 10\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'medium', 'accepted', '2026-02-27 03:49:42', '', '2026-02-27 03:49:42', '2026-03-06 06:37:52'),
(649, 124, 'Holi Card', 'Vildambic, Cloff, VFX & Roxid', 2, 10, 'create holi card - Vildmabic, Cloff, VFX & Roxid Wishing you a vibrant and joyful Holi filled with colors of happiness, prosperity, and good health. May this festival bring new beginnings, positivity, and success into your life. Let the spirit of togetherness and celebration brighten your days ahead. Have a safe, colorful, and delightful Holi! 🌸🎨', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-27 05:04:27', '', '2026-02-27 05:04:27', '2026-03-02 05:12:13'),
(650, 148, 'Zivemp-SM Conference Standee', 'Zivemp-SM', 1, 7, 'For impactful brand visibility at medical conferences, a Zivemp-SM standee is essential. It reinforces scientific positioning, highlights the extended-release triple combination benefits, and attracts doctors’ attention amid competitive promotion. A well-designed standee strengthens recall, supports field communication, and enhances professional brand presence, driving meaningful engagement and prescription confidence. requirement is urgent', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-27 05:38:08', '', '2026-02-27 05:38:08', '2026-03-04 08:56:00'),
(651, 129, 'TELLZY GROUP  BRAND LOGO STICKER', 'TELLZY,TELLZY AM,TELLZY MT,TELLZY CH', 1, 2, 'Create Tellzy all brand logo stickers in high-resolution vector format with transparent background, print-ready CMYK colors, and consistent brand guidelines. Include festive stickers for Holi, Gudi Padwa, and Rakhi with vibrant themes. Maintain proper logo proportions, clear visibility, and export in PNG, PDF, and AI formats suitable for printing and digital use.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'pending', '2026-02-27 06:04:00', '', '2026-02-27 06:04:00', '2026-02-27 06:04:00'),
(652, 137, 'PERUMADI VA THEME PAGE', 'PERUMADI', 3, 16, 'VA THEME PAGE OF PERUMADI UDDER DEVELOPMENT BRAND . CREATING THEME OR STORY RELATING SERVICING BIKE. PERUMADI- UDDER KA ENGINE OIL. STORY CREATION NEEDED. 1ST PAGE ONLY. BIKE REQUIRE SERVICING AFTER PARTICULAR TIME PERIOD LIKE THAT UDDER NEED REPAIR OF CELLS EVERY LACTATION. LIKE THIS WE HAVE TO RELATE AND 3-4 LINES ONLY REQUIRED', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-27 06:38:48', '', '2026-02-27 06:38:48', '2026-03-02 06:53:05'),
