(661, 116, 'Budget Meeting Video Rise of Olympus ', 'Maxis Division all focus brand ', 2, 11, 'Rise of Olympus – The Rising Year\r\nThis past year was not easy.We felt the pressure. We faced obstacles. And yes—our sales results did not reflect our true potential.\r\nBut today is not about what went wrong. Today is about what comes next.\r\nIn Greek mythology, Mount Olympus was not reached by chance. It was climbed through strength, resilience, and belief. And that is exactly where we are right now—at the base of the mountain, ready to rise.\r\nThis year tested us. It tested our strategy, our discipline, and our mindset. But challenges don’t break strong teams—they reveal them. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-28 09:03:06', '', '2026-02-28 09:03:06', '2026-03-18 09:39:10'),
(662, 116, 'Budget Meeting Video - Theme: Rise of Olympus – The Rising Year', 'Maxis Division all focus brand ', 3, 16, 'This past year was not easy.We felt the pressure. We faced obstacles. And yes—our sales results did not reflect our true potential.\r\nBut today is not about what went wrong.Today is about what comes next.\r\nIn Greek mythology, Mount Olympus was not reached by chance. It was climbed through strength, resilience, and belief. And that is exactly where we are right now—at the base of the mountain, ready to rise.\r\nThis year tested us. It tested our strategy, our discipline, and our mindset. But challenges don’t break strong teams—they reveal them. \r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-28 09:08:42', '', '2026-02-28 09:08:42', '2026-03-12 08:40:59'),
