(721, 41, 'ROxid LBL', 'Roxid', 1, 1, 'Roxid LBL will be developed based on the existing VA of Roxid.\r\nPlease use the 300 mg strength, as this is the only strength currently in use.\r\nThe Roxid VA is already available with the Pharma Division.\r\nPage details:\r\nPage 1 – Fever, throat pain, URTI, cough and cold, and AOM\r\nPage 2 – Roxithromycin and Cefpodoxime parameters\r\nPage 3 – SSTI infection', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'in_progress', '2026-03-12 02:53:48', '', '2026-03-12 02:53:48', '2026-03-17 18:31:00'),
(722, 63, 'Women\'s Day Posts', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'As discussed this morning, we request your support with the following items for Women’s Day:\r\n1.	Greeting card design to be included within the hamper\r\n2.	Invitation card covering the event details and explaining the usage of the Gratitude Cards\r\n3.	Gratitude Cards design\r\n4.	Cake design\r\n5.	Inclusion of the line: “Carry your sunglasses for the event” in our planned communications\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-03-12 05:00:29', '', '2026-03-12 05:00:29', '2026-03-13 05:57:50'),
(723, 63, 'FOCUS Leaderboards', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'Add the FOCUS masthead on the top and mention the reward line at the bottom.\r\n \r\n \r\n2024-25	2025-26	FOCUS Objective	Nov-25	*Predictive Annualised Attriton\r\nExits	Attrition %	Annualised Attrition Rate ( Sept 25)		Exits (YTD Nov 2025)	Attrition % YTD Nov 2025	\r\n						\r\n \r\nReward: Division and Cluster Heads who meet or exceed their retention targets will be recognized at the end of the financial year.\r\n \r\nAlso, the leaderboard will be made cluster-wise and the names will be mentioned as per the excel sheet itself.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-03-12 05:02:24', '', '2026-03-12 05:02:24', '2026-03-13 04:55:51'),
(724, 63, 'Field Communication', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'We are saddened by the passing away of Mr. Akhilesh Juluru, on the 4th of March, 2026. This is a tragic and distressing moment, and our thoughts are with everyone who knew and worked with him.\r\n\r\nAkhilesh had submitted his resignation from Alembic Pharmaceuticals, just a day prior. In his parting note as he moved on, he had also expressed appreciation for the support he received at Alembic and spoke warmly about the colleagues he had worked with. Despite our sincere efforts to retain him, given his strong performance and contribution to the organization, he had chosen to move on.\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'pending', '2026-03-12 05:04:12', '', '2026-03-12 05:04:12', '2026-03-12 05:04:12'),
(725, 63, 'World Kidney Day SM Post', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'Kidney Health for All\r\nCaring for People, Protecting the Planet. While World Kidney Day is a year-round campaign, you can help mark 20 years of World Kidney Day by taking action on March 12, 2026. Every action helps move kidney care higher on the global health agenda.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-03-12 05:07:25', '', '2026-03-12 05:07:25', '2026-03-13 04:34:40'),
(726, 162, 'Veldrop Preamble Video', 'Veldrop', 3, 15, 'Veldrop video for cycle meeting contains the opening that shows veldrop is beyond lubrication and connecting it with bollywood dialogue', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\",\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\",\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-03-12 06:27:51', '', '2026-03-12 06:27:51', '2026-03-12 07:23:14'),
(727, 43, 'Modification in VA', 'Oryza Ceramax', 1, 1, 'There is medical modification in the Oryza Ceramax VA in Page 1 and 3. There is medical modification in the Oryza Ceramax VA in Page 1 and 3. There is medical modification in the Oryza Ceramax VA in Page 1 and 3. There is medical modification in the Oryza Ceramax VA in Page 1 and 3.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-03-12 09:05:34', '', '2026-03-12 09:05:34', '2026-03-12 11:00:17'),
(728, 153, 'TZH VA FY 27 Animation', 'TELLZY-H/AH/BS', 2, 10, 'Convert the static visual aid graphics into simple professional animations for iPad detailing presentations.\r\n\r\n• Use clean medical infographic-style animations with smooth and minimal motion.\r\n\r\n• Prefer fade-in, sequential appearance, and simple flow animations to help explain the content step-by-step.\r\n\r\n• Ensure animations visually support the narration of the representative and make the slides more engaging for doctors.\r\n\r\n• Avoid flashy, fast, or distracting effects; maintain a professional pharmaceutical presentation style.\r\n\r\n• Keep animation smooth, clear, and easy to understand so that the key message of the slide is communicated effectively.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'in_progress', '2026-03-12 09:39:43', '', '2026-03-12 09:39:43', '2026-03-15 18:31:00'),
(729, 115, 'Need QR code for the trial report PDF', 'Docmycin', 4, 26, 'Need to convert pdf into qr code, we have to attach that QR code in the VA page, so that doctor can scan it and download the pdf article.\r\n\r\nNeed to convert pdf into qr code, we have to attach that QR code in the VA page, so that doctor can scan it and download the pdf article.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-03-12 09:51:16', '', '2026-03-12 09:51:16', '2026-03-13 06:58:07'),
