(732, 64, 'Gastron Motivational Video', 'Deltone Exceraft Freego Rafle', 2, 11, 'As we prepare for the upcoming Cycle Meeting, we would need your expertise to develop a motivational video based on the theme “Udaan… Rising Beyond Limits.”\r\nKindly create the video using the attached script as the base reference. The objective is to build excitement and motivate the team by highlighting the spirit of determination, resilience, and the drive to push beyond limits. To make the video more engaging and impactful, you may also incorporate relevant movie scenes along with powerful visuals, transitions, and motivating background music.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-03-12 11:51:10', '', '2026-03-12 11:51:10', '2026-03-13 10:55:19'),
