(268, 41, 'glass table top', 'New Livfit and Lactonic granules', 1, 3, 'Design a box cover for New Livfit and Lactonic Granules to be placed on the glass tabletop during the brand launch. \r\nThe cover should feature single branding only. \r\nTwo separate artworks (AW) will be created, one for each brand, to maintain distinct brand identity and clarity.\r\nThe box should contain Introducing and the name of the brand ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-01-28 05:23:31', '', '2026-01-28 05:23:31', '2026-02-25 04:44:19'),
