(272, 129, 'TELLZY MT VA', 'TELLZY MT', 1, 1, 'I want to create a visual advertising design for next year that incorporates fresh creativity and a modern design approach. The objective is to present information in a way that is simple, visually appealing, and easy to read and understand at a glance. The design should communicate key messages clearly, engage the audience effectively, and leave a strong, lasting impression through clean layouts and impactful visuals.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-01-28 06:47:29', '', '2026-01-28 06:47:29', '2026-02-05 07:23:10'),
