(274, 116, 'Wikoryl Liquid VA revamp ', 'Wikoryl Liquid', 1, 1, 'We have to revamp old VA of Wikoryl Liquid Range, Total 6 pages are there \r\n1st page - Wikoryl TRUST the 1st Page\r\n2. Quality Checks - 200+ Quality Checks \r\n3. Advantage of Micronised rechenology\r\n4. Symptom reduction in 5 days\r\n5. 75 ml closer pack \r\n6. Wikoryl Drops \r\n7. Wikoryl DS ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-01-28 07:50:06', '', '2026-01-28 07:50:06', '2026-02-18 09:09:41'),
