(276, 134, 'Visual Aid Q-2 All focus 10 Brand with Non Focus Brand', 'All Farmcure Brand ', 1, 1, 'A visual aid folder (specifically in a professional, marketing, or pharmaceutical context) is a physical or digital tool designed to support a speaker or sales representative during a presentation. Its primary objective is to enhance communication by combining oral, visual, and textual information to make, break, or sell a product or idea. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-01-29 04:38:18', '', '2026-01-29 04:38:18', '2026-03-16 11:36:38'),
