(279, 134, 'CLOSAL LBL', 'CLOSAL', 1, 1, 'For the treatment and control of mixed helminth infestations in cattle / sheep / goats caused by:Triclabendazole: Anthelmintic (Benzimidazole derivative)\r\n\r\nMoxidectin: Endectocide (Macrocyclic lactone – Milbemycin group\r\nTriclabendazole-sensitive parasites\r\n\r\nFasciola hepatica (early immature, late immature & adult liver flukes)\r\n\r\nFasciola gigantica\r\n\r\nMoxidectin-sensitive parasites\r\n\r\nGastro-intestinal nematodes (Haemonchus, Ostertagia, Trichostrongylus, Cooperia, Bunostomum, Oesophagostomum)\r\n\r\nLungworms (Dictyocaulus spp.)\r\n\r\nExternal parasites (as per formulation): mites, lice', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-01-29 05:19:17', '', '2026-01-29 05:19:17', '2026-02-09 10:37:51'),
