(285, 131, 'Sleeve artwork box', 'Sleeve artwork box ', 1, 3, 'Brands neds to kept on sleeve artwork box. \r\n1st Sleeve Brands:\r\n1.SHARKOFERROL\r\n2. MINAL FORTE ADVANCED\r\n3. PROMIX Y \r\n4. AVIDEFENCE\r\n\r\n2nd Sleeve Brands:\r\n1.SHARKOFERROL\r\n2. MINAL PLUS\r\n3. PROMIX Y \r\n4. AVIDEFENCE\r\n\r\nQUOTE: Designed to support metabolic efficiency and growth in summer \r\n\r\nSupporting faster, uniform growth across the flock  \r\n\r\nrequest to use Summer or heat stress artwork theme\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-01-29 09:18:41', '', '2026-01-29 09:18:41', '2026-02-03 03:35:06'),
