(287, 103, ' AWARENESS AND CELEBRATION DAYS - FEBRUARY 2026', 'All Brands', 3, 16, '2nd Feb – Rheumatoid Arthritis Awareness Day – Aletol DS & Aletol Bolus\r\n10th Feb – National Deworming Day – Mectin Inj & Mectin Bolus\r\n11th Feb – International Day of Women and Girls in Science – Mceft & Xceft\r\n12th Feb – Sexual and Reproductive Health Awareness Day – Gynatrop , Posterity & Aldstenol\r\n14th Feb –  Valentine Day – Theme related to animal \r\n15th Feb – Mahashivratri \r\n18th Feb – Ramadan (Start Date)* \r\n19th Feb – Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Jayanti \r\n20th Feb – International Urogynecology Day \r\n24th Feb – Animal Health Day \r\n27th Feb – World Protein Day \r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-01-29 09:44:50', '', '2026-01-29 09:44:50', '2026-02-16 03:48:17'),
(288, 139, 'Cataract Post Operation Care Instructions Leaflet', 'Nepafenac', 1, 2, 'Cataract Post-Operation Care Instructions leaflet is a critical patient-education tool that reinforces the doctor’s advice beyond the clinic. It improves compliance, reduces post-surgical complications, builds patient confidence, and positions the doctor as thorough and patient-centric—strengthening trust, outcomes, and long-term brand recall for the practice. To be printed and sent to doctors', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-01-29 09:53:06', '', '2026-01-29 09:53:06', '2026-02-09 04:58:32'),
(290, 139, 'GIEP Program Note Pad', 'Travisight', 1, 2, 'GIEP Program Notepad is a practical clinic utility that supports daily patient documentation while reinforcing the GIEP initiative. It ensures consistent program visibility at the point of care, aids structured note-taking, and subtly strengthens brand recall by integrating the program seamlessly into routine clinical practice. I will Print this A5 Size', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'assigned', '2026-01-29 10:45:22', '', '2026-01-29 10:45:22', '2026-01-30 12:45:41'),
(291, 99, 'World Cancer Day Awareness Greeting', 'Perumadi', 1, 2, 'World Cancer Day Greeting \r\n\r\nThe World Cancer Day 2026 theme is “United by Unique,” running from 2025 to 2027. Led by the UICC, this campaign emphasizes that while every cancer journey is unique, the global community is united in reducing disparities, promoting personalized, compassionate care, and seeing the person before the patient. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-01-29 10:55:55', '', '2026-01-29 10:55:55', '2026-02-03 10:01:32'),
(292, 139, 'BE Free Campaign', 'Travisight', 3, 15, 'Create engaging, evidence-led content that translates the clinical finding that BBFC added to Travoprost significantly lowers mean diurnal IOP at 6 weeks versus Travoprost alone. Position Travoprost as foundational PGA therapy and BBFC as the logical, science-backed adjunct when target IOP is unmet. Focus on clear visuals, treatment-step logic, and ethical, study-aligned messaging.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\",\"Print\",\"Mobile\",\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-01-29 11:01:35', '', '2026-01-29 11:01:35', '2026-03-02 09:25:29'),
(293, 128, 'Rekool D Motivation Video ', 'Rekool D ', 2, 10, 'Objective of the Video\r\n\r\nRecharge team energy\r\n\r\nBring back belief in Rekool D\r\n\r\nReinforce “why Rekool D matters”\r\n\r\nCreate ownership, not pressure. \r\n\r\nCore message:\r\n\r\n“Rekool D is not just a product. It’s relief. It’s trust. It’s our legacy.” \r\n\r\nThe Video will be played in Cycle meeting and can be used for Brand Campaign ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-01-29 11:03:09', '', '2026-01-29 11:03:09', '2026-02-14 08:42:32'),
