(304, 122, 'Slab Input Design', 'Azithral, Wikoryl, Brozeet LS, Rekool, Ulgel, Lave', 1, 2, 'Retailer Slab Input Design.Take reference from the PPT attached.Retailer Slab Input Design.Take reference from the PPT attached.Retailer Slab Input Design.Take reference from the PPT attached.Retailer Slab Input Design.Take reference from the PPT attached.Retailer Slab Input Design.Take reference from the PPT attached.Retailer Slab Input Design.Take reference from the PPT attached.Retailer Slab Input Design.Take reference from the PPT attached.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-01-30 07:06:28', '', '2026-01-30 07:06:28', '2026-02-03 06:17:18'),
(305, 89, 'Esolembic-D New VA Page- GP & ENT', 'Esolembic-D', 1, 1, 'This project involves developing a high-impact visual aid for Esolembic-D, designed to clearly communicate its unique selling propositions in the management of acid reflux–related discomfort and sleepless nights. The cover page visually represents the patient journey from nighttime distress caused by reflux symptoms to restful, uninterrupted sleep after effective treatment. Through strong imagery, thoughtful color contrast, and minimal yet powerful messaging, the visual aid emphasizes fast relief, sustained acid control, and improved sleep quality. The objective is to help healthcare professionals quickly convey the therapeutic value of Esolembic-D, making patient counseling more engaging, relatable, and clinically meaningful.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-01-30 08:06:21', '', '2026-01-30 08:06:21', '2026-02-01 14:31:01'),
(306, 115, 'HD Photo of a India Book of record certificate', 'No brand', 5, 31, 'Need high resolution photo of the India Book of record certificate\r\nNeed high resolution photo of the India Book of record certificate\r\nNeed high resolution photo of the India Book of record certificate\r\nNeed high resolution photo of the India Book of record certificate . . . .  . .', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-01-30 09:40:30', '', '2026-01-30 09:40:30', '2026-02-05 06:24:26'),
(307, 134, 'CLOSAL POSTER', 'CLOSAL', 1, 2, 'Triclabendazole + Moxidectin is a powerful dual-action antiparasitic combination—especially relevant for dairy cattle where mixed parasite burden is common.Cows rarely have one parasite. Most dairy animals face endo + ecto parasites + liver flukes together, leading to:Reduced milk yield\r\n\r\nPoor body condition\r\n\r\nInfertility issues\r\n\r\nHeavy economic losses (very relevant in Indian dairy conditions)', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-01-30 10:16:07', '', '2026-01-30 10:16:07', '2026-02-16 06:58:14'),
(309, 131, 'Kolkata Poultry fair 2026 ', 'Kolkata poultry fair 2026 Invitation letter ', 1, 2, 'Single page invitation letter for Kolkata poultry fair 2026. Single page invitation letter for Kolkata poultry fair 2026. Single page invitation letter for Kolkata poultry fair 2026.Single page invitation letter for Kolkata poultry fair 2026.Single page invitation letter for Kolkata poultry fair 2026.Single page invitation letter for Kolkata poultry fair 2026.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-02 02:57:27', '', '2026-02-02 02:57:27', '2026-02-03 04:43:29'),
(310, 100, 'Cycloset LBL for April\'26', 'Cycloset', 1, 1, 'Subject: Assignment: Preparation of April LBL – Cycloset\r\nDear Team,\r\n\r\nPlease proceed with the preparation of the Cycloset LBL for the month of April.\r\nThe LBL should be 50 words, doctor-focused, and designed for a 1-page A4 format.\r\nKindly share the draft and artwork within the agreed timeline.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nRiddhi', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-02-02 05:53:53', '', '2026-02-02 05:53:53', '2026-02-13 04:38:39'),
(311, 100, 'Ovigyn DH VA pages', 'ovigyn DH', 1, 1, 'Subject: Assignment: Preparation of Ovigyn DH VA pages\r\nDear Team,\r\n\r\nPlease proceed with the preparation of the Ovigyn DH va pages for the month of April.\r\nThe VA pages  should be 2 pager, doctor-focused, and designed for a Desktop purpose\r\nKindly share the draft and artwork within the agreed timeline.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nRiddhi', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'pending', '2026-02-02 05:58:09', '', '2026-02-02 05:58:09', '2026-02-02 05:58:09'),
(312, 105, 'Advert for Tripura Conference ', 'Resync,Travisight,Veldrop', 1, 2, 'The approved advertisement requires minor modifications in dimensions, brand name placement, and logo sizing to ensure consistency with updated brand guidelines and optimal visual clarity. No changes have been proposed to the core message, creative concept, or communication intent of the advertisement while maintaining compliance with internal and regulatory standards', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-02 09:11:04', '', '2026-02-02 09:11:04', '2026-02-05 05:55:57'),
(313, 63, 'Zara Nachke Dikha', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'Alembic - Zara Nach Ke Dikha (Dance Competition) is designed as a warm, inclusive engagement initiative that invites Alembic employees and their families to showcase their love for dance through short recorded video clips. By actively involving family members, the initiative strengthens the emotional connection between employees’ personal and professional lives, reinforcing Alembic’s culture of care that extends beyond the individual employee.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\",\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-02 09:59:50', '', '2026-02-02 09:59:50', '2026-03-05 04:54:53'),
(314, 71, 'Uncle G Video Series', 'Geripod/Geripod D', 2, 11, 'Situation 1: Uncle-G coming out out of a door(with washroom sign)with flush sound in background, once door closes flush sound stops & “ssss”(urination sound begins), thought bubble appears with “Really? Still not empty”, and he turns back.\r\nSituation 2: Uncle G is in  the zoo with grand kids, where they are trying to show him tiger, but a bubble appears with the humanized washroom door coming(with eyes,mouth,hand) and “sss” sound in the background\r\nSituation 3: Uncle G is trying to meditate with focus(om appears) , sudden shivers and a bubble appears with the humanized washroom door coming and “sss” sound \r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-02 10:08:41', '', '2026-02-02 10:08:41', '2026-02-12 11:11:04'),
(315, 64, 'Gastron RCPA Card', 'Deltone Exceraft Freego Rafle', 1, 1, 'This RCPA card has already been designed. \r\nWill attach the content of Rafle (like Competitor Brand Names, Company name, Sku and MRP). Need to replace Monovono with Rafle.\r\nKeep the font size, color and overall look same as before.\r\nJust replace the brands.\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-02 10:58:29', '', '2026-02-02 10:58:29', '2026-02-03 09:07:42'),
(316, 95, 'Budget meeting - Diary Artwork', 'Corazon Division', 1, 5, 'We are planning a Diary for internal field force for which we require Artwork \r\nThe Diary include below pages  \r\nCover page uddan theme ,  Theme pages, Brand logo  Rosave & Glipy , Brand theme start early & carb overload , Amplify, Productive call, New year calender, Division head letter head addresing the team.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-02 11:19:32', '', '2026-02-02 11:19:32', '2026-02-06 12:35:32'),
(317, 146, 'DIVISION LOGO DEVELOPMENT', 'FERTIMAX', 1, 4, 'NEW INNOVATIVE , CREATIVE DIVISION LOGO TO CREATED , WHICH WILL RESEMBLE MAXIMUM FERTILITY IN DAIRY ANIMALS FERTIMAX LOGO TO BE CREATED WHICH WILL BE FOR OUR NEW DIVISION ,IT WILL BE LAUNCHED IN NEXT 2MONTHS . I AM SHARING OUR EXISTING VETMAX  DIVISION LOGO FOR REFERENCE SO THAT DEVLOPING ARTIST WILL HAVE AN BETTER IDEA', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-03 02:44:18', '', '2026-02-03 02:44:18', '2026-02-18 09:10:43'),
(318, 69, 'All India Derma Championship Certificates ', 'Derma Vidya', 1, 2, 'We wnat to design 12 certificates for the PG Quiz conducted by DermaVidya, covering 6 zonal winners and 6 national round winners. These certificates will be used to formally felicitate the winning doctors. Hard copies will be presented during clinic visits, while soft copies will be shared via email for their records and wider professional use.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-03 03:28:38', '', '2026-02-03 03:28:38', '2026-02-09 06:41:11'),
(319, 34, 'RESYNC PLUS LOGO AND PACK SHOT', 'RESYNC', 1, 4, 'I want to create a brand logo for my upcoming new sku of Resync i.e Resync Plus which content sodium hyaluronate 0.18%. logo should be sync with other 2 sku of Resync. Resync Plus there are 2 SKU i.e 10 ml & 5 ml as Resync. Kinldy provide 5 options of logo design', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-03 04:36:33', '', '2026-02-03 04:36:33', '2026-02-18 09:31:29');
INSERT INTO `work_requests` (`id`, `user_id`, `project_name`, `brand`, `request_type_id`, `project_id`, `description`, `about_project`, `priority`, `status`, `requested_at`, `remarks`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(320, 129, 'TELLZY AM SURVEY LBL', 'TELLZY AM', 1, 1, 'This content has been developed by referring to the attached PDF for scientific context and the provided Word file for structuring key pointers, with a clear and impactful heading marked with an asterisk (*) and supported by the statement “Data on File,” ensuring that the information is presented in simple, grammatically correct sentences that highlight the clinical relevance, therapeutic benefits, and practical applicability for doctors in day-to-day patient management, while maintaining clarity, credibility, and professional communication standards.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-03 04:43:21', '', '2026-02-03 04:43:21', '2026-02-09 04:45:21'),
(321, 147, 'Grogain Pro VA page design', 'Grogain Pro', 1, 1, 'One page to create for Grogain Pro VA , other pages will remain same\r\nThis page has before and after images of patients after using Grogain pro hair serum.\r\nWe will provide the final images within 2,3 days of time. meanwhile you can start working on the designing the page', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-03 07:17:53', '', '2026-02-03 07:17:53', '2026-02-06 11:52:09'),
(322, 148, 'Zivemp-SM Whatsapp Sticker', 'Zivemp-SM', 1, 2, 'need to create a whatsapp sticker for today\'s special request for the new launched brand Zivemp_SM. creative sticker that mention\'s today\'s special request is zivemp-SM with logo of the same and that can be shared over whatsapp with all the doctors every morning by our sales people. urgent requirement please', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-03 08:26:26', '', '2026-02-03 08:26:26', '2026-02-09 08:48:25'),
(323, 149, 'Rosave EZ - VA FY 26-27', 'Rosave EZ', 1, 1, 'Rosave EZ Visual Aid has to be updated for next financial year. \r\nThere will Addition in the existing Visual Aid as per the discussion with medical Team. \r\nMajorly, Patient profile and Dual Mechanism of Rosuvastatin + Ezetimibe combination has to be added . . . . . . . . ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-03 08:43:44', '', '2026-02-03 08:43:44', '2026-02-18 04:28:43'),
(325, 105, 'PegTears HP Cycle Meeting', 'PegTears HP', 3, 15, '1.	Three Teaser videos to be sent to the field force by end of February \r\n2.	Reveal of the Healing Partner Symbol at the Budget Meeting along with the Comeback Music Concept \r\n3.	Engagement Activities at Cycle Meetings – Word Games (Match the Column, Find the Word)\r\n4.	Monthly Flyer/Short Video correlating healing partner for that month \r\n5.	Gamification Concept for Doctors   \r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\",\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-03 09:52:12', '', '2026-02-03 09:52:12', '2026-02-23 10:15:29'),
(326, 119, 'TufeHeart_Brand Recall_Jan_2026', 'Tufehart 4 Videos', 2, 10, 'Tufehart videos will be used as a strategic communication tool to strengthen brand positioning while simplifying dosage and administration. Brand-focused videos will highlight rapid iron repletion, symptom improvement, and better clinical outcomes, whereas dosage videos will provide clear, step-by-step guidance to build prescribing confidence. This integrated video approach enables consistent, engaging education across touchpoints, driving faster adoption and stronger trust in Tufehart.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-03 10:24:41', '', '2026-02-03 10:24:41', '2026-02-04 07:20:40'),
(327, 150, 'Photo Frame for Anemia Awarness day 13th Feb', 'Richar CR', 4, 18, 'Want a Weblink based photo frame for world Anemia awareness day to be held on 13th Feb the Photo frame to be like Doctor is Pledging for Anemia Awareness, the frame to be in colors of Richar CR , the team will Click Doctors Photo with this Frame and Share to doctor', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-03 10:32:38', '', '2026-02-03 10:32:38', '2026-02-17 12:46:27'),
(328, 69, 'Valentine\'s day frame', 'Oryza Sensitive', 1, 1, 'Create a personalised Valentine’s Day digital experience themed #FramedWithLove for doctors. A link will be shared by representatives, allowing doctors to enter their name and upload a photo with a loved one. The system will auto-generate a premium, branded frame with “Framed with Love” and Oryza & Oryza Sensitive branding, which doctors can preview, download, and share digitally, ensuring a simple, emotional, and memorable engagement.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-03 10:56:17', '', '2026-02-03 10:56:17', '2026-02-12 07:24:38'),
(329, 113, 'Conference Banner Changes Gastron', 'Gastron Division', 1, 7, 'As we are participlating conferences pan-India, representing our presence along with strong brand visibility is crucial to gain increased prescriptions and attract attention from top specialty KOLs.\r\n\r\nRequesting you to kindly make the following changes in the conference material CDR \r\n\r\nChanges from Existing Gastro CDR:\r\n\r\n1. Deltone brand logo\r\n2. Replace Monovono with Rafle with reference\r\n3. Reference', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Others\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-03 11:05:47', '', '2026-02-03 11:05:47', '2026-02-04 12:59:19'),
(330, 139, 'Sample Dispenser Artwork', 'Travisight', 1, 3, 'This box is a therapy starter pack for managing elevated IOP, designed for in-clinic use by physicians. The artwork should convey treatment initiation, confidence, and early control, highlighting a clear beginning of therapy (Aarambh), scientific credibility, and patient reassurance, without being promotional or cluttered. Please design according to reflect the theme', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-04 05:23:34', '', '2026-02-04 05:23:34', '2026-03-10 10:16:35'),
(331, 151, 'Digital Eye strain artwork', 'Veldrop', 1, 3, 'Need 20- 20- 20- Digital Eye strain rule engraved on pen.\r\n\r\nDesigned to reduce eye fatigue, the 20-20-20 rule says that every 20 minutes of screen time, you should look away at something at least 20 feet away for at least 20 seconds. These regular screen breaks give your eyes some much-needed rest and help prevent eye strain.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-04 05:53:38', '', '2026-02-04 05:53:38', '2026-02-09 04:40:49'),
(332, 63, 'SCM Award Artwork', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'Sharing the images and the content below for the artwork where Sachin Sir has received the Outstanding Supply Chain Leader award.\r\n \r\nPath to access images: \"Y:\\# Corp Comm\\SCM\\Award\"\r\n\r\nAt Alembic Pharmaceuticals, we continue to lead from the front, transforming challenges into opportunities and setting new benchmarks in supply chain leadership.\r\n \r\nPicture of Sachin Sir receiving the award & the certificate\r\nCongratulations Dr. Sachin Ghosalkar\r\nOutstanding Supply Chain Leader – NextGen SCM Summit 2026\r\n \r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Others\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-04 06:17:29', '', '2026-02-04 06:17:29', '2026-02-06 08:34:06'),
(333, 63, 'Doctor\'s Appreciation Collage', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'Please add the below copy to the collage:\r\n\r\nYour relationship-building opportunity is live now. Today’s handshakes and moments of gratitude are tomorrow’s stronger collaborations. Let’s present the ‘Thank You’ cards and make connections. Here is the google drive link for your reference where all the photos with field reps from different divisions were added.\r\n\r\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1p2kOYBVx4x5yAT2Po4J9IbxkCM8Zv5nQ?usp=sharing\r\n\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-04 06:19:34', '', '2026-02-04 06:19:34', '2026-02-04 08:42:58'),
(334, 63, 'Sikkim Plant Certificate TV', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'Please help in making the requested TV artwork with the attached certificate and below given content. Here\'s the content-\r\nHeadline: Sikkim Plant Felicitated by Government of Sikkim\r\nBody Copy: For strengthening public healthcare at Rhenock Community Health Centre by enhancing service delivery and access to quality healthcare for the local community.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Others\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-04 06:21:47', '', '2026-02-04 06:21:47', '2026-02-05 10:34:14'),
(335, 63, 'GPTW Social Media and TV artwork', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'Please see below content. \r\nArtwork Text (for Social Media Visual)\r\n \r\nGreat Place to Work® Certified\r\n4 Years in a Row\r\n \r\nAlembic Pharmaceuticals logo\r\nPowered by our people\r\n \r\n \r\nEmpower notification content:\r\n \r\nHeadline:\r\nGreat Place to Work® Certified – 4 Years in a Row\r\n \r\nBody copy:\r\nThis recognition belongs to every colleague who brings trust, care, and commitment to work each day.\r\nFour years in a row—because of you.\r\nThank you for making Alembic a place we are truly proud to call our workplace.\r\n \r\n I also need to replace the GPTW Logo on our Desktop Wallpaper.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-04 06:24:27', '', '2026-02-04 06:24:27', '2026-02-06 08:36:58'),
(336, 151, 'Eyecare portfolio banner', 'Resync Veldrop Travisight', 1, 7, 'Need CDR open file of the size as mentioned in the description - Length 28 cm x Breadth 20cm. It will be used for the Tripura Ophthalmology conference.\r\n\r\nDesign a professional, modern conference banner conveying innovation, knowledge sharing, and collaboration. Use clean typography, balanced layout, and subtle gradients. Include space for conference title, date, venue, and logos. Visuals should feel inspiring, credible, and engaging for a diverse professional audience.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-04 06:24:37', '', '2026-02-04 06:24:37', '2026-02-09 04:48:52'),
(337, 63, 'Doctor\'s Appreciation Week', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'The daily push creatives were prepared with one-liners to incentivise and motivate the medical representatives to hand over the thank you cards to maximum doctors. The initiative lasted for a month wherein the MRs were told to ask for prescriptions support for their respective brands along with the appreciation of the work they do in the healthcare community.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-04 06:29:23', '', '2026-02-04 06:29:23', '2026-02-24 10:59:07'),
(338, 63, 'Social Media Post for World Cancer Day', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'The theme is #UnitedbyUnique where every experience is unique and it will take all of us, united, to create a world where we look beyond the disease and see the person before the patient. TV artwork and social media posts were prepared for the topical day on the respective theme.\r\n \r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\",\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'medium', 'assigned', '2026-02-04 06:32:32', '', '2026-02-04 06:32:32', '2026-02-04 10:42:02'),
(339, 145, 'Ulgeraft LBL 1', 'Ulgeraft', 1, 1, 'Need artwork as per the image. Need artwork as per the image. Need artwork as per the image. Need artwork as per the image. Need artwork as per the image. Need artwork as per the image. Need artwork as per the image. Need artwork as per the image. Need artwork as per the image. Need artwork as per the image. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\",\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-04 06:37:45', '', '2026-02-04 06:37:45', '2026-02-06 10:52:23'),
(340, 59, 'Gestofit VA ', 'Gestofit ', 1, 1, 'Update the VA page of the Gestofit brand by realigning all elements across the slides based on the attached reference. Exclude Slide 7 from realignment; instead, create Slide ,  7 using the data and content provided within it, ensuring consistency, clarity, and visual alignment throughout the  VA Page of Gestofit  ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-04 08:54:22', '', '2026-02-04 08:54:22', '2026-03-13 12:28:40'),
(341, 144, 'QR CODE GENERATION', 'HOSPICARE', 4, 26, 'To enhance virtual webinar speaker engagement, a QR code–based invite system can be implemented for seamless participation. A unique QR code will be generated and shared with invitees through email, WhatsApp, or digital creatives. By scanning the QR code, participants can instantly register or join the webinar, reducing manual effort and improving attendance. This approach ensures quick access, accurate attendee tracking, and a smooth user experience. QR-based invitations also add a professional, tech-enabled touch to the webinar communication, making it easier for invitees to engage with the speaker session efficiently and on time.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-04 09:17:34', '', '2026-02-04 09:17:34', '2026-02-13 10:43:15'),
(342, 128, 'Rekool D CLM Video Campgain ', 'Rekool D ', 2, 12, 'CLM Video Series : \r\n\r\nMPDR Technology\r\nMACE \r\nFaster, Stronger & Longer Vs pantoprazole \r\nSafe PPI \r\nQuality 227 times \r\nEach video 30 sec which will highlight Brand USP and increase brand recall in doctor clinic \r\n\r\nFor USP VA already submitted  \r\n\r\nMPDR Technology\r\nMACE \r\nFaster, Stronger & Longer Vs pantoprazole \r\nSafe PPI \r\nQuality 227 times ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\",\"Field Representatives\",\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-04 09:27:25', '', '2026-02-04 09:27:25', '2026-02-25 04:25:07'),
(343, 116, 'Animation in Wikoryl Liquid VA', 'Wikoryl Liquid ', 2, 13, 'Animation Required to show micronised technology in Wikoryl Liquid Page. Glycerrocherry  Technology in Wikoryl Drops to represent soothing effect in the throat  \r\nAnimation Required to show micronised technology in Wikoryl Liquid Page. Glycerrocherry  Technology in Wikoryl Drops to represent soothing effect in the throat  \r\nAnimation Required to show micronised technology in Wikoryl Liquid Page. Glycerrocherry  Technology in Wikoryl Drops to represent soothing effect in the throat  ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-04 10:27:27', '', '2026-02-04 10:27:27', '2026-02-27 07:36:57'),
(344, 59, 'Lactonic and Livfit Standee ', 'Lactonic & Livfit ', 1, 7, 'Please create standees for Lactonic and Livfit .  using the content provided in the reference file. Ensure each standee highlights the brand logo clearly , covering 35% of the total space. .  Keep the layout clean, visually appealing, well-aligned, and consistent with each brand’s look for strong visibility and impact', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-04 10:44:51', '', '2026-02-04 10:44:51', '2026-02-10 04:27:55'),
(345, 126, 'Wikoryl Brand Videos Series 2026', 'Wikoryl Solids', 2, 10, 'Wikoryl videos need to highlight 50 years of legacy, trust, and manufacturing excellence. The visuals and imagery should be strong enough to clearly represent and communicate this. All drafts and the required images have been shared, please utilize the same to ensure the best outcome. If required, please use additional images for better depiction.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'assigned', '2026-02-04 11:05:20', '', '2026-02-04 11:05:20', '2026-02-05 07:16:12'),
(346, 149, 'Rosave EZ - survey LBL', 'Rosave EZ', 1, 1, 'Rosave EZ survey LBL- Content has to be updated in previous template\r\n\r\nContent\r\n                             \r\n•The majority of HCPs (68%) reported Ezetimibe as the most commonly used drug with statin,\r\n•The majority of HCPs (77%) reported that ezetimibe is best added when LDL-C goals are not achieved despite maximally tolerated statin therapy,\r\n•The majority of HCPs (73%) prescribed the combination therapy in dyslipidemia with Type 2 diabetes mellitus (T2DM) patients\r\n•Significant LDL-C reduction after initiating rosuvastatin + ezetimibe combination  & The majority of HCPs (54%) observed significant LDL-C reduction\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-04 11:10:10', '', '2026-02-04 11:10:10', '2026-02-18 13:42:51'),
(347, 153, 'TZH KOL Byte FEB 2026', 'TELLZY-H/AH', 2, 14, 'This is an ongoing KOL Byte video series delivered by an internationally recognized speaker, designed to share expert insights in a concise and engaging format. The videos will be enhanced with supportive animations to improve clarity and retention, while detailed scientific and product information will be presented through an interactive iPad-based e-LBL experience.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-05 05:51:45', '', '2026-02-05 05:51:45', '2026-02-05 09:58:49'),
(348, 115, 'Horizontal A5 size artwork 500 crore celebrations', 'No brand', 1, 2, 'Need an a5 size artwork showing 500 crore sales of Animal Health team, also in that image show celebrations and attach photos of cow, dog, buffalo, goat, cat, poultry (white), eggs and fish. for reference have attached a photo also please do the needful, as we need it by today 4pm, cause we want it to be given for printing and distribute to our HO team and also display it on LCD screen', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-05 05:59:29', '', '2026-02-05 05:59:29', '2026-02-05 13:12:41'),
(349, 91, 'Glisen Reminder Card', 'Glisen group, Glisen SM ', 1, 1, 'Need A5 size front back reminder card for Glisen Group in which one side Glisen MF, Glisen MF Forte, Glisen PM, Glisen VM & Glisen will be there and other side Glisen SM 1 Gliusen SM 2, Glisen 1/2/500 & Glisen SM 2/50/500 branding will be there  and along with the ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-05 06:21:32', '', '2026-02-05 06:21:32', '2026-02-23 13:48:20'),
(350, 154, 'Clostop SRX LBL Issue 1', 'Clostop', 1, 1, 'Dysmenorrhea associated with menorrhagia affects nearly 2–4 out of every 5 women, significantly impacting quality of life. Clostop SRx offers effective relief with its RDI technology and MC-disintegrant for faster action, ensuring better compliance—while being up to 15% more cost-effective for long-term management. Kindly prepare a LBL for the same\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-05 06:51:35', '', '2026-02-05 06:51:35', '2026-02-16 05:35:32'),
(351, 94, 'Box Artwork', 'Ulgeraft, Rekool, Vonofide, Etrik', 1, 3, 'Design a box artwork for mentioned brands for regular input dispatch cycle. A premium box artwork that reflects brand credibility and scientific trust. Prioritize strong visual hierarchy, clear product identity, and regulatory compliance. Use modern typography, consistent color coding, and sharp layout alignment. Ensure readability, shelf differentiation, and adaptability across pack sizes while maintaining unified brand aesthetics.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-05 07:41:52', '', '2026-02-05 07:41:52', '2026-02-18 04:17:21'),
(352, 99, 'National Deworming Day Greeting', 'Minthal & Sharkoferrol', 1, 2, 'Make Greeting concern with large animals.\r\n\r\nNational Deworming Day (NDD) is a biannual health initiative in India, held on February 10 and August 10, aiming to deworm children aged 1–19 years to combat parasitic worm infections. Led by the Ministry of Health and Family Welfare, it is one of the world\'s largest public health campaigns, administering free Albendazole tablets at schools and Anganwadi centers to improve child health, nutrition, and education. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-05 08:55:05', '', '2026-02-05 08:55:05', '2026-02-06 08:32:12'),
(353, 155, 'standee recreation/reformatting', 'L&D Team Event', 1, 7, 'Two standees which were created last year by Digi team need to update the same with new logos and few content change as per the current theme. Change in great place to work, preferred workplace for women and L&D team logo change. Change in the content focus agenda of the team meeting and changing the Financial year.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-05 10:15:18', '', '2026-02-05 10:15:18', '2026-02-11 06:56:47'),
(354, 139, 'Travisight- PF Brand Anniversary', 'Travisight-PF', 3, 15, 'Create a congratulatory card for doctors marking 1 year of TRAVISIGHT. The card should express gratitude for their trust and support, highlight the milestone of one successful year in glaucoma management, and reinforce TRAVISIGHT’s commitment to sustained IOP control and continued scientific partnership. This will goo on Ipad  or Through Whatsapp ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\",\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-05 10:49:16', '', '2026-02-05 10:49:16', '2026-02-14 08:43:52'),
(355, 139, 'Travisight-PF Brand Anniversary Video ', 'Travisight-PF', 2, 10, 'Create a short celebratory animation marking 1 year of TRAVISIGHT. Highlight the journey from launch to one successful year, doctor trust, and consistent glaucoma management outcomes. The tone should be professional, scientific, and appreciative, ending with gratitude to doctors for partnering in TRAVISIGHT’s growth. This will go on Ipad also', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"iPad 9\",\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-05 11:27:57', '', '2026-02-05 11:27:57', '2026-02-11 05:26:44'),
(356, 60, 'Roxid Inclinic Hand Sanitizer', 'Roxid', 1, 3, 'Request to Please share the artwork for Roxid hand Sanitizer. Below mentioned are the dimensions and statement to be written. Box Dimension: \r\nL 85mm X W 77mm X H 180mm\r\n Statement: With Best Compliments from Roxid . Additionally Please incorporate the Alembic Logo If any queries Please do let me know', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-06 05:26:16', '', '2026-02-06 05:26:16', '2026-02-09 06:43:29'),
