(359, 152, 'Box Artwork', 'Vitaresp FX', 1, 3, 'Need to design box artwork for Vitaresp FX. The Vitaresp FX box artwork is designed exclusively for doctors, keeping clinical relevance and scientific clarity at the core. The compact yet structured dimensions allow clear presentation of the brand name on the main panel, ensuring instant recall during prescription. Side panels can be optimally used to highlight core indications, key differentiating benefits, and evidence-based messaging in a concise format. The overall artwork should maintain a sober, premium medical look that reinforces Vitaresp FX as a dependable, rational, and doctor-trusted respiratory therapy option.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-06 06:59:11', '', '2026-02-06 06:59:11', '2026-02-18 04:15:34'),
(360, 157, 'World Anaemia Awareness Digital Activity', 'richar fcm', 4, 17, 'For World Anaemia Awareness Day, create an interactive iPad page highlighting the current prevalence of anaemia. The page should prompt the MR to touch the Richar FCM logo, triggering an interactive transition that reveals key anaemia prevalence data and insights. The interaction should be smooth, intuitive, and visually engaging to support impactful doctor conversations.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\",\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-06 08:08:33', '', '2026-02-06 08:08:33', '2026-02-10 05:30:04'),
(361, 108, 'Requirement of Opener Page – AQI & Allergic Rhinitis Prevalence for LMOL VA', 'Laveta M Liquid', 1, 1, 'I would like to request the development of an opener page for the Visual Aid of LMOL, focusing on Air Quality Index (AQI) and the prevalence of Allergic Rhinitis linked to air pollution.\r\n\r\nThe objective of this opener is to set a strong clinical and environmental context, highlighting the growing burden of allergic rhinitis due to deteriorating air quality, thereby creating relevance for LMOL in routine practice.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-06 08:28:30', '', '2026-02-06 08:28:30', '2026-02-17 08:55:28'),
