(363, 59, 'Lactonic LBL ', 'Lactonic Granules ', 1, 1, 'Create three Leave Behind Literatures (LBLs) for the brand Lactonic Granules as per all corrections mentioned in the slides. Update layouts and images accordingly. On LBL 1 back side, replace “Shatavari + 6 ingredients” with “Shatavari + 5 Natural Ingredients.” Ensure all content aligns with breastfeeding facts, brand guidelines, and a professional, caring design tone', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-06 09:20:00', '', '2026-02-06 09:20:00', '2026-02-24 07:37:22'),
(364, 105, 'Lasik and Contact Lens Education Series ', 'PegTears HP', 3, 16, 'Develop a series of simple, visually engaging content pieces explaining LASIK basics for the field force. Focus on what LASIK is, why patients opt for it, how the procedure is done at a high level, and which doctors perform it. Content must be non-clinical, non-promotional, easy to understand, and suitable for WhatsApp consumption, creating a clear foundational understanding of LASIK.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"iPad 10\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-06 09:40:42', '', '2026-02-06 09:40:42', '2026-02-14 08:35:28'),
(365, 105, 'PegTears HP Visual Aid', 'PegTears HP', 1, 1, 'Update the visual aid to align with the LASIK and healing-phase narrative. Content should introduce LASIK context, highlight the post-procedure comfort phase, and position PegTears HP as a supportive healing partner. Visuals must be clean, calm, and reassurance-led, avoiding heavy clinical details or hard selling. The flow should support doctor conversations during the recovery and comfort phase.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-06 09:42:15', '', '2026-02-06 09:42:15', '2026-03-03 10:57:50'),
