(368, 150, 'Richar CR HB Camp Thank you Card A5 ', 'Richar CR', 1, 2, 'A A5 Size Thank you card to be Given to Doctor post HB camp\r\nthe Thank you card to to have message saying that, Thank you Doctor for Allowing the Reach Her HB Camp for your Patients\r\nTotal Patients Screened for HB ___   Total Patient Found with Low HB__________\r\nThank you for helping identify and treat patient with Low HB \r\n\r\nRequesting to Confirm the Date for Next HB Camp ______________', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-06 11:56:03', '', '2026-02-06 11:56:03', '2026-02-11 06:55:20'),
(369, 137, 'GIF for chelated Ca bioavailability', 'Ascal Gold', 2, 11, 'GIF showing difference between non-chelated and chelated Calcium that how it reacts in rumen fluid and absorption in the intestine.  Non chelated Ca reacts with ruminal fluid and reached intestine very less amount so only small quantity gets absorbed through intestine. where as chelated Ca does not reacts in rumen fluid so more quantity reached till intestine and gets properly absorbed in intestine.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-09 04:24:55', '', '2026-02-09 04:24:55', '2026-03-02 07:41:59'),
(370, 147, 'Grogain Pro VA page ', 'Grogain Pro', 1, 1, 'Just need to change one word in the first VA page of Grogain Pro. Page is already ready and was made by earlier artist Navneet. Ready page can be received from his back up files. Let me know once you assign this to artist. Expecting this to be completed by tomorrow as only one word needs to be changed', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-02-09 04:26:41', '', '2026-02-09 04:26:41', '2026-02-10 01:30:21'),
