(376, 60, ' Box Artwork for Cloff', 'Cloff Os', 1, 3, 'Design a premium, clean box artwork for Cloff OS with a professional pharmaceutical look. Use a modern color palette, subtle gradients, and minimal medical graphics. The design should prominently feature the line “With Best Compliments from Cloff OS”, conveying trust, quality, and brand elegance. \r\nPlease Take this up on priority.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-09 06:07:19', '', '2026-02-09 06:07:19', '2026-02-18 09:10:20'),
(377, 149, 'Rosave EZ- Expert Opinion Series', 'Rosave EZ', 2, 14, 'Expert opinion Series for Rosave EZ. \r\n\r\nThis series include 1 min video of Key opinion leader on Rosuvastatin + Ezetimibe combination which is to be utilized in IPAD. \r\nEvery video will have Disclaimer, Intro slide, video transcript , summary slide. \r\n\r\nThis series is applicable for entire FY 2026 - 2027. \r\n\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-09 06:45:46', '', '2026-02-09 06:45:46', '2026-02-12 05:34:55'),
(378, 102, 'Brand photo shoot required', 'Ascal gel advance', 5, 31, 'For New launch brand ASCAL GEL ADVANCE\r\nBrand shoot required for New launch brand ASCAL GEL ADVANCE\r\n1. HD quality pic is required from all angles.\r\n2. A rotating video is also required to be used as GIF\r\nKindly do the needful on priority \r\nPlease share in JPEG and PNG format\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Print\",\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-09 06:51:19', '', '2026-02-09 06:51:19', '2026-02-13 06:24:40'),
(379, 44, 'Voage MS VA Design', 'Voage MS', 1, 1, 'Cover Page:- Image of 3 patient profile in rotation\r\nImage of a office going corporate Lady of (40-45) years with busy schedule/sedentary lifestyle and overweight\r\nImage of a retired old man, obese of (60-65) years with Cardiovascular disease\r\nImage of a busy housewife of (45 - 50) years busy & sedentary lifestyle and overweight\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-09 07:00:12', '', '2026-02-09 07:00:12', '2026-02-19 06:46:54'),
(381, 64, 'Exceraft Airport Video ', 'Exceraft', 2, 10, 'Kindly help in designing suitable brand related videos. Exceraft, an alginate-based antacid has been in the market for the past 3 years. Exceraft is recently being introduced in a new sleeve packaging with a new pack size, while the formulation, benefits, and communication pointers remain unchanged. Exceraft stands for fast and long-lasting relief from acid reflux and heartburn, due to its raft-forming action that physically prevents acid from coming back up the food pipe. It is a trusted solution for quick relief, offering comfort and protection for patients suffering from acid reflux and GERD-related symptoms.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-09 07:50:17', '', '2026-02-09 07:50:17', '2026-02-19 10:42:46'),
(382, 64, 'Exceraft Late Night Haunting Video', 'Exceraft', 2, 10, 'Kindly help in designing suitable brand related videos. Exceraft, an alginate-based antacid has been in the market for the past 3 years. Exceraft is recently being introduced in a new sleeve packaging with a new pack size, while the formulation, benefits, and communication pointers remain unchanged. Exceraft stands for fast and long-lasting relief from acid reflux and heartburn, due to its raft-forming action that physically prevents acid from coming back up the food pipe. It is a trusted solution for quick relief, offering comfort and protection for patients suffering from acid reflux and GERD-related symptoms.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-09 07:51:15', '', '2026-02-09 07:51:15', '2026-02-19 06:01:06'),
(383, 64, 'Exceraft Pacman Video', 'Exceraft', 2, 10, 'Kindly help in designing suitable brand related videos. Exceraft, an alginate-based antacid has been in the market for the past 3 years. Exceraft is recently being introduced in a new sleeve packaging with a new pack size, while the formulation, benefits, and communication pointers remain unchanged. Exceraft stands for fast and long-lasting relief from acid reflux and heartburn, due to its raft-forming action that physically prevents acid from coming back up the food pipe. It is a trusted solution for quick relief, offering comfort and protection for patients suffering from acid reflux and GERD-related symptoms.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-09 07:52:13', '', '2026-02-09 07:52:13', '2026-02-20 06:45:49'),
(384, 134, 'Alvite M- Fat Mobilization', 'Alvite M', 2, 11, '“Choline chloride helps liver export fat by increasing VLDL formation, preventing fatty liver and ketosis during early lactation.” “Choline chloride helps liver export fat by increasing VLDL formation, preventing fatty liver and ketosis during early lactation.”“Choline chloride helps liver export fat by increasing VLDL formation, preventing fatty liver and ketosis during early lactation.”', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-09 08:32:14', '', '2026-02-09 08:32:14', '2026-02-17 09:52:14'),
(385, 69, 'Oryza sensitive A+ pages - New', 'Oryza Sensitive', 1, 2, 'We plan to create a few new Amazon A+ content pages that communicate our brand story in a more consumer-friendly and engaging manner. The content should be creative, visually appealing, and easy to understand, with a clear focus on sensitive skin concerns. It should effectively highlight the product’s key benefits, science, and usage, while ensuring strong and intuitive product placement for shoppers.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Others\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-09 08:40:50', '', '2026-02-09 08:40:50', '2026-02-24 08:06:26'),
(386, 139, 'Adjunctive Therapy  Visual Aid', 'Travisight + Brinzemic- B', 1, 1, 'When prostaglandin analogues alone are not enough, adding BBFC provides superior adjunctive control. The PGA + BBFC combination delivers enhanced and sustained IOP reduction, addressing multiple pathways to achieve better pressure stability. A smarter step-up approach for patients who need more than monotherapy—because optimal IOP control demands a comprehensive, synergistic solution.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-09 10:11:27', '', '2026-02-09 10:11:27', '2026-02-26 08:50:25'),
(387, 144, 'TENT CARD, NOTEPAD ARTWORK , APPRECIATION CERTIFICATE ARTWORK ', 'HOSPICARE', 1, 5, 'Design a premium tent card, appreciation certificate, and budget meeting notepad artwork aligned with Alembic Hospicare’s corporate branding. The notepad artwork should prominently display the Alembic Hospicare logo, venue name, and meeting date, presented in a clean, structured layout suitable for senior leadership and executive use. The appreciation certificate must be fully editable and easily accessible, enabling quick customization of recipient details and insertion of achievement percentages. Overall, the design should convey motivation, recognition, and performance excellence through elegant typography, subtle graphic elements, and consistent brand colors, ensuring a cohesive, professional, and impactful visual identity for the budget meeting . ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'assigned', '2026-02-09 11:11:20', '', '2026-02-09 11:11:20', '2026-02-23 09:50:05'),
(388, 101, 'KHURAK VA VIDEO', 'Khurak', 2, 12, ' Video given we required it is for the brand Khurak which is feed supplement & we want the video for our visual aid theme page , video will show how khurak is applicable or recommended in every life stage of cattle\'s like wise we want to show in video . ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-10 04:43:45', '', '2026-02-10 04:43:45', '2026-02-18 11:11:17'),
(389, 101, 'Khurak VA Video- 2 ', 'Khurak', 2, 12, 'Required video for the brand Khurak which will show khurak packet pouring in front of cow & from the power we have to indicate 5 ingredient which we have given in khurak powder .  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\",\"Others\"]}', 'medium', 'assigned', '2026-02-10 05:04:19', '', '2026-02-10 05:04:19', '2026-02-19 05:07:00'),
(390, 101, 'Vetamx Visual AId  - 1', 'Mceft, Tishuheal, Almizol Spray, Khurak', 1, 1, 'Vetmax division Cycle 1  visual aid - 1 for the brands Mceft , Tishuheal , Almizol Spray , Khurak  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\",\"Others\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-10 05:14:32', '', '2026-02-10 05:14:32', '2026-03-04 09:48:15'),
(391, 105, 'EYECARE BUDGET MEETING ', 'VELDROP TRAVISIGHT RESYNC', 1, 7, 'The theme logo should be simple, scalable, and impactful, working seamlessly across stage backdrops, presentations, collaterals, and digital formats. Avoid overly illustrative elements. The logo must visually reflect progress, direction, and continuity into the next cycle. Typography should be clean and bold, ensuring readability from a distance and consistency across all applications.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-10 05:37:20', '', '2026-02-10 05:37:20', '2026-02-20 07:14:59'),
(392, 105, 'BUDGET MEETING THEME ', 'VELDROP TRAVISIGHT RESYNC', 3, 16, 'We’re currently working on the theme for the upcoming Budget & Cycle Meeting and need your support on developing the theme-related content.\r\n\r\nThe content should clearly articulate the idea of progress, alignment, and readiness for the next cycle, while maintaining a strong corporate and leadership-oriented tone. Please keep the language crisp, purposeful, and motivating—avoid anything overly promotional, festive, or abstract.\r\n\r\nThis content will be used across theme explanations, presentations, and supporting communication, so clarity and consistency are key.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\",\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-10 05:47:36', '', '2026-02-10 05:47:36', '2026-03-02 07:03:42'),
(393, 147, 'Grogain Pro 1 year celebration feedback booklet', 'Grogain Pro', 1, 5, 'This will be A5 size booklet on which we will be taking Drs feedback of using Grogain Pro since last 1 year. This will have front cover back cover and inside 30 pages for feedback. We want this booklet to look premium hence please suggest few more design options. Earlier designs can be modified as some content has changed and need premium design.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-10 05:58:12', '', '2026-02-10 05:58:12', '2026-03-04 09:45:37'),
