(398, 99, 'Ramadan Greeting', 'C4ALL', 1, 2, 'Kindly provide a greeting for Ramadan.\r\n\r\n\r\nRamadan is the ninth month of the Islamic calendar. It is observed by Muslims worldwide as a month of fasting, communal prayer, reflection, and community. It is also the month in which the Quran is believed to have been revealed to the Islamic prophet Muhammad. Ramadan is the ninth month of the Islamic calendar. It is observed by Muslims worldwide as a month of fasting, communal prayer, reflection, and community. It is also the month in which the Quran is believed to have been revealed to the Islamic prophet Muhammad.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-02-10 07:47:45', '', '2026-02-10 07:47:45', '2026-02-18 04:30:30'),
(399, 115, 'Need certificate of participation and appreciation ', 'No brand', 1, 2, 'Need a certificate for participation and appreciation for doctor.\r\nEarlier this was made from your team, In that same format just need to change the doctor\'s name photo, topic date and signature.\r\nHave attached those certificate draft ppt in the mail and also the signature for attachment . . .', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-10 07:57:21', '', '2026-02-10 07:57:21', '2026-02-11 10:18:54'),
(400, 123, 'POULTRY 100 Cr Milestone Post ', 'Poultry', 1, 2, 'The artwork is for the sales achievement of 100 Cr by the Poultry Division of Animal Health Cluster. The post will be displayed on the office screen and also shared in the interact. \r\n\r\nRequesting you to create the artwork as per the PPT reference file shared in the attachment. Let us know whom to connect.  ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-10 08:39:24', '', '2026-02-10 08:39:24', '2026-02-27 06:45:10'),
(401, 131, 'festive greeting for Mahashivratri  & Shiv Jayanti ', 'Sharkoferrol , Promix Y & Minal plus ', 1, 2, 'Festive Greetings for Mahashivratri   & Shiv Jayanti. Festive Greetings for Mahashivratri   & Shiv Jayanti.Festive Greetings for Mahashivratri   & Shiv Jayanti.Festive Greetings for Mahashivratri   & Shiv Jayanti.Festive Greetings for Mahashivratri   & Shiv Jayanti.Festive Greetings for Mahashivratri   & Shiv Jayanti.Festive Greetings for Mahashivratri   & Shiv Jayanti.Festive Greetings for Mahashivratri   & Shiv Jayanti.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-10 08:48:30', '', '2026-02-10 08:48:30', '2026-02-11 12:30:47'),
(402, 99, 'Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Jayanti Greeting', 'Moxel & Sharkoferrol', 1, 2, 'Dear Team, Kindly Provide the Greeting. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nShiv Jayanti, also known as Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj festival, is a festival and public holiday of the Indian state of Maharashtra. This festival is celebrated on February 19, celebrating the birth anniversary of Shivaji Maharaj, the first Chhatrapati of the Marathas. He established Hindavi Swarajya. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-10 08:52:25', '', '2026-02-10 08:52:25', '2026-02-18 05:08:38'),
(403, 99, 'Animal Health Day Greeting', 'Alvite-M', 1, 2, 'Provide a greeting.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis year\'s theme focuses on the importance of teamwork in veterinary care, acknowledging that effective veterinary services often rely on the ...This year\'s theme focuses on the importance of teamwork in veterinary care, acknowledging that effective veterinary services often rely on the ...This year\'s theme focuses on the importance of teamwork in veterinary care, acknowledging that effective veterinary services often rely on the ...', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-10 08:58:05', '', '2026-02-10 08:58:05', '2026-02-23 05:56:03'),
(404, 64, 'Shivaji Jayanti Flyer', 'Deltone Exceraft Freego Rafle', 1, 2, 'Help us in designing a Shivaji Jayanti watsapp flyer. It would contain 4 Focussed brands, Deltone Exceraft Freego Freego PEG and Rafle. The flyer should reflect the spirit of Shivaji Jayanti with a patriotic and professional look, aligning with our brand identity. Also attaching the pdf from which the logos can be taken.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-10 09:21:17', '', '2026-02-10 09:21:17', '2026-02-16 11:09:20'),
(405, 102, 'Visual aid design', 'Xceft, Ascal Gel,  & Aldstenol', 1, 1, 'Visual aid sheets to be uploaded on tab\r\nTab size design required for below brands\r\n1. Xceft, \r\n2. Ascal Gel,  \r\n3. Aldstenol\r\nText will be shared once artist is allocated. Kindly do the needful on priority. . . . . . . . . . . \r\n\r\nVisual aid sheet design required for Quarter 1 of 2026-27. \r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-10 09:31:36', '', '2026-02-10 09:31:36', '2026-03-10 07:30:25'),
(406, 144, 'Video Creation for budget meeting for marketing ', 'HOSPICARE', 2, 10, 'Kindly develop a theme centered on three teams working together as one unified force. The concept should highlight our collective achievement of 81 Cr, our 91 Cr target for the upcoming year, and the ambitious Mission Impossible – 100 Cr milestone ahead. The narrative must strongly convey collaboration, shared ownership, and collective success, showcasing how all three teams contribute toward one common vision and sustained future growth. Visually, the theme should depict three teams—Unicorn, Pegasus, and Access—climbing together, supporting one another from behind and ascending as one using ropes. The theme video should follow a high-energy action-movie style.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-10 10:42:36', '', '2026-02-10 10:42:36', '2026-02-23 05:53:11'),
(407, 160, 'VA - SITALEMBIC MD', 'SITALEMBIC MD', 1, 1, 'Want to design VA for SItalembic-MD. As during MD Brand plan presentation, we have di=escribed about the project & we have got the First copy of VA cut. Kindly now have made few correction in the VA as per medical , which need  rectification, Kindly Update the same so that we can go ahead with incorporation in the IPAD', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\",\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\",\"Others\",\"Chemists\",\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-10 11:05:38', '', '2026-02-10 11:05:38', '2026-03-12 08:28:15'),
