(411, 43, 'Peel kit packaging design', 'Oryza Sensitive', 1, 3, 'The peel kit packaging is designed to ensure safety, sterility, and ease of use, while clearly communicating step-wise application. Distinct visual coding for each component enhances compliance and minimizes errors. Premium, clinically aligned aesthetics reinforce credibility, support doctor confidence, and improve patient perception, making the treatment process organized, intuitive, and professionally reassuring for effective outcomes.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-11 03:58:27', '', '2026-02-11 03:58:27', '2026-02-17 08:36:44'),
(412, 67, 'Chemist Stationery Kit Artwork - Cardigem Division ', 'Glisen SM,Glisen MF,Tellzy H, Rosave Gold,Tufehart', 1, 3, 'Kindly create a branding label to be used on a box of stationery kit with the dimension of the label 9 cm * 14.5 cm with the brand names in the following order : \r\n\r\nOrder on Left one below the other : Glisen SM, Glisen MF, Glisen PM, Glisen VM\r\nOrder on Right one below the other: Tellzy H_AH, Tellzy BS, Rosave Gold, Tufehart\r\n\r\nLogo of Alembic on the top right corner.\r\nKeep the design simple with white background and minimal border on the top and bottom.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-11 04:27:47', '', '2026-02-11 04:27:47', '2026-02-18 04:18:58'),
