(434, 124, 'Vildambic box artwork ', 'Vildambic M', 1, 3, 'Design a clean, professional, and premium-looking Vildmabic box highlighting trust and efficacy. Use brand colors with strong product visibility. Include “With Best Compliments” prominently on the front. Add key benefits, modern typography, and a medical aesthetic. Ensure readability, doctor-focused appeal, and space for dosage, composition, and branding elements.\r\nDESIGN ARTWORK ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-12 09:48:46', '', '2026-02-12 09:48:46', '2026-02-18 09:11:35'),
(435, 44, 'Leaders Budget Meeting Motivational Video', 'Summit Div', 2, 11, 'Create a high-energy, inspirational opening video for the Summit Budget Meeting 2026 based on the theme “LEAP FORWARD – Together We Can. Together We Will.” The video should reflect challenge, resilience, leadership, teamwork, and growth. Start with visuals of obstacles, slow progress, and market realities, then transition into momentum, unity, and success. Use strong typography for keywords: Leadership, Execution, Accountability, Performance, Collaboration. End with a powerful reveal of LEAP FORWARD and SUMMIT 2026 logo. Music should build from emotional to motivational. Duration: 45 seconds to 1 min. Tone: bold, premium, and corporate.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'assigned', '2026-02-12 11:40:20', '', '2026-02-12 11:40:20', '2026-02-18 09:27:34'),
(436, 122, 'Certificates', 'Azithral, Wikoryl, Brozeet LS, Rekool, Ulgel, Lave', 1, 2, 'Certificates designing for Annual meet.Certificates designing for Annual meet.Certificates designing for Annual meet.Certificates designing for Annual meet.Certificates designing for Annual meet.Certificates designing for Annual meet.Certificates designing for Annual meet.Certificates designing for Annual meet.Certificates designing for Annual meet.Certificates designing for Annual meet.Certificates designing for Annual meet.Certificates designing for Annual meet.Certificates designing for Annual meet.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-12 15:09:54', '', '2026-02-12 15:09:54', '2026-03-11 05:52:58'),
(437, 122, 'Holi Video for Doctors', 'Azithral, Wikoryl, Brozeet LS, Rekool, Ulgel, Lave', 2, 10, 'Holi video for Doctors. This video will be circulated in tier 2 and tier 3 cities so make the language very simple and message very clear. Branding is done at the done with all Algrow promoted brands as was done in earlier festival videos. This will be circulated to Doctors.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-13 03:42:44', '', '2026-02-13 03:42:44', '2026-02-25 10:35:54'),
(438, 63, 'Best Wishes Mailer for Board Exams ', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'We would like to send a warm best-wishes mailer to employees whose children are appearing for the Class 10th and 12th Board Examinations, acknowledging this as an important milestone for both students and parents.\r\n \r\nIn the same communication, we can keep a reminder about the recently launched Parents Work From Home for Mumbai HO Employees, enabling them to better balance work and family needs during the exam period. We can include a path to the policy for employees to refer the policy.\r\n \r\nPath: Empower\r\nKnowledge Database \r\nPolicies – Corporate\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-13 04:41:35', '', '2026-02-13 04:41:35', '2026-02-16 05:27:02'),
(439, 98, 'World Kidney Day collaterals', 'CETANIL', 1, 1, 'World Kidney day collateral needs to be designed as per attachments. Danglers, Poster design.\r\nKindly help to send the world kidney day collaterals.\r\n \r\nYou can refer some options from below link , Pls rework on design content is mentioned already.\r\nhttps://www.transfernow.net/dl/20260212qyedDVtx/VuKRDa18\r\n \r\n \r\nPls change the World Kidney day date-12th Mar\r\n\r\nany doubt pls call', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-13 04:49:25', '', '2026-02-13 04:49:25', '2026-03-13 04:15:22'),
(440, 63, 'Top MR Productivity Calls', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'Every week the top MRs from each division are celebrated for maximum productive calls which translates into improved business outcomes. The spotlight feature is done in the form of weekly leaderboards. The data is received from the business excellence team and shared with the HR team. They forward the data internally and it\'s added into the leaderboards.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-13 04:55:00', '', '2026-02-13 04:55:00', '2026-02-16 05:34:23'),
(441, 63, 'Happy Lohri Wishes for TV Screen', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'As discussed, request you to please share the creative that will be circulated by Namita Ma’am to all DHs and CHs. The email communication is planned to go out on 5th January 2026.\r\n \r\nYou can refer to the trail email for reference. As part of this initiative, AMs, RMs, and ZMs will be requested to procure the sweet boxes (Gajak / Chikki) and distribute them accordingly\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-13 04:56:38', '', '2026-02-13 04:56:38', '2026-02-16 05:28:18'),
(442, 63, 'Alembic Timeline Pithampur', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'Sharing below the JPEG version of the timeline which needs to installed at the visitors sitting area, outside the admin room and inside the production unit (entrance room).\r\n\r\nRequest you to kindly engage the vendor and let us know the cost.\r\n\r\nKindly note, we need to print the timeline in opaque colour.\r\n\r\nOnce the cost is approved, I’ll then share the high-resolution AI files for printing.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Others\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-13 04:58:01', '', '2026-02-13 04:58:01', '2026-02-23 07:21:07'),
(443, 63, 'Circle of Champions Certificate', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'Please find below the certificate content for the Circle of Champions initiative.\r\nCIRCLE OF CHAMPIONS\r\nCertificate of Excellence\r\n\r\nPresented to\r\nArea Manager Name)\r\nIn recognition of superior performance and the delivery of outstanding business results in Q4 of 2025.\r\nThe undersigned in the format will be the leaders: MD and CHRO respectively.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-13 05:01:00', '', '2026-02-13 05:01:00', '2026-02-16 05:27:41'),
(444, 63, 'CHRO Communication for the Corporate Film ', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'Subject Line 118 Years of Heritage, A Future of Innovation Watch Our Corporate Film\r\n\r\nDear Alembians,\r\n\r\nOur 118-year story is one of progress, commitment, and trust. Now, we bring it to life.\r\nI am delighted to share our new corporate film. More than a look back, it’s a celebration of our present and future. It’s powered by you, our 18,000-strong team.\r\nIn it, you’ll see the determination and collective spirit that make our ‘circle of healing’ real. We encourage you to share it with your network. \r\nThank you for being the vital force behind our enduring legacy.\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-13 05:02:50', '', '2026-02-13 05:02:50', '2026-02-16 05:36:40'),
(445, 43, 'All brand reminder card', 'Corium', 1, 1, 'Designing brand reminder cards for the sales field involves creating concise, visually impactful aids that reinforce key brand messages, benefits, and recall cues. These cards support quick reference during doctor interactions, ensuring consistent communication. Strategic layout, strong branding, and memorable visuals enhance retention, improve detailing effectiveness, and help drive stronger brand recall and prescription confidence.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-13 06:28:26', '', '2026-02-13 06:28:26', '2026-02-24 08:08:54'),
(446, 88, 'Carb Overload Tent Card ', 'Glipy Group', 1, 2, 'An A5 double side print tent card.\r\nIt should have Dish Name then Carb Content in the Dish.\r\nLeave space to write the dish name and carb content in the dish.\r\nAttached is the world diabetes day poster kindly use this poster to add the elements of the poster like the person eating food. \r\nThe artwork will be in the die cut format kindly create the artwork accordingly.\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-13 06:47:28', '', '2026-02-13 06:47:28', '2026-02-16 13:01:06'),
(448, 143, 'Cloff Motivational Anthem', 'Cloff', 3, 16, 'Provide a song with a motivation feel to amp up the motivation of all the attendees of the cycle meeting. this song will set the tone of the cycle meeting and help encourage the attendees to feel energised and work hard towards their brand. Moreover, the song will create an energetic vibe in the meeting.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-13 07:46:10', '', '2026-02-13 07:46:10', '2026-02-17 05:15:59'),
(449, 138, 'RUMIGEST LAUNCH VIDEO', 'RUMIGEST', 2, 10, 'RUMIGEST LAUNCH VIDEO to be in digital form. It should be like 1st time introducing a brand to customer in market.\r\ndetails are in ppt. Duration - 5 to 10 seconds. \r\nRUMIGEST LAUNCH VIDEO to be in digital form. It should be like 1st time introducing a brand to customer in market.\r\ndetails are in ppt. Duration - 5 to 10 seconds. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-13 10:46:52', '', '2026-02-13 10:46:52', '2026-03-10 10:25:57'),
(450, 43, 'Sample packshot', 'oryza Range', 5, 31, 'A pack shoot involves capturing high-quality, accurate images of the product packaging for use across marketing and promotional materials. It requires precise lighting, correct angles, and brand-consistent presentation to highlight design details, texture, and readability. These images strengthen visual identity, ensure professional representation, and support communication across digital, print, and sales platforms effectively.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'low', 'accepted', '2026-02-13 11:32:27', '', '2026-02-13 11:32:27', '2026-02-23 07:25:11'),
