(453, 34, 'RESYNC - VIDEO SCRIPT FOR CYCLE MEET - DHURANDHAR', 'RESYNC', 3, 16, 'In upcoming cycle meet which will be new financial year start, for Resync I want to create a video to motivate the team member in cycle meet.\r\n\r\nFor these we are thinking of DHURANDHAR (CURRENLY LAUNCH MOVIE), which is hot topic now days and it will help team to motivate through message and Resync performance.\r\n\r\nOur Objective for 2026-27 for Resync is – To achieve 1 Cr sale every month with 80% SOP\r\n\r\nCan you please help us with Video Script and pre buss for same, which will help a lot.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-13 12:01:14', '', '2026-02-13 12:01:14', '2026-03-12 09:21:06'),
(454, 43, 'Women\'s Day Video', 'Oryza Acne Clear', 3, 15, 'Conceptualized and scripted a Women’s Day video highlighting the confidence and strength of women supported by the Oryza range. Developed a compelling narrative aligned with brand benefits, translated clinical value into emotional storytelling, created storyboard and visual flow, and produced a high-quality video integrating brand messaging for impactful doctor and patient engagement and recall.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-13 15:13:50', '', '2026-02-13 15:13:50', '2026-02-23 10:14:43'),
(456, 43, 'Women\'s day video', 'Oryza Acne Clear', 2, 10, 'Conceptualized and scripted a Women’s Day video highlighting the confidence and strength of women supported by the Oryza range. Developed a compelling narrative aligned with brand benefits, translated clinical value into emotional storytelling, created storyboard and visual flow, and produced a high-quality video integrating brand messaging for impactful doctor and patient engagement and recall.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-13 15:16:26', '', '2026-02-13 15:16:26', '2026-03-09 03:26:24'),
(457, 43, 'Holi Video', 'Oryza range', 2, 10, 'Conceptualized and scripted a Post-Holi care video showcasing skin challenges caused by colors and pollution, and how the Oryza range supports skin recovery and barrier restoration. Developed narrative, storyboard, and visual direction, translating product benefits into engaging storytelling, and produced a high-quality video to enhance brand recall, doctor communication, and patient relevance.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-02-13 15:17:22', '', '2026-02-13 15:17:22', '2026-02-23 07:14:04'),
(458, 99, 'Estrofit Video For VA', 'Estrofit Bolus', 2, 11, 'Kindly make the of given silde one after one\r\n\r\n\r\nthe estrus cycle of a cow is generally about 21 days long but can span 17-24 days, beginning when the cow reaches its peak estrogen secretion and is “in estrus,” which can last from 6 to 24 hours. Ovulation generally occurs 24 to 32 hours after the beginning of estrus and marks the beginning of the luteal phase. After ovulation, germ cells mature into follicles containing FSH receptors in a process called “oogenesis,” where they grow in follicular waves.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\",\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-14 07:52:40', '', '2026-02-14 07:52:40', '2026-03-10 02:39:25'),
(459, 59, 'Tellzy VA ', 'Tellzy ', 1, 1, 'Create a  Tellzy visual aid while preserving the original content structure. Enhance Slide 1 with high-quality imagery. Insert the original Tellzy strip image on Slide 2. Present Slides 3–6 in a more creative layout without changing data, updating doctor-patient visuals on Slides 5 and 6. Improve formatting for Slides 7–9', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-15 08:33:29', '', '2026-02-15 08:33:29', '2026-02-24 06:27:51'),
(460, 44, 'Budget Meeting Artwork', 'Summit Div', 1, 7, 'Wanted to create the Budget meeting collaterlas \r\nBox Gate Arch 8\'ft x12\'ft x8ft \r\nBransing Side Pannels Backdrop with flex and frame finishing - 4ft x 10ft\r\nStandees 8ft X 4 ft-  6 QTY\r\nPledge Wall Backdrop flex and frame finishing  8\'ft x 8\'ft-1\r\nSunboard Cutout photobooth 5ft -1\r\nPhoto backdrop-1\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'critical', 'accepted', '2026-02-15 11:20:17', '', '2026-02-15 11:20:17', '2026-02-16 11:43:56'),
(461, 88, 'Glipy Group Camp Poster', 'Glipy Group', 1, 2, 'Create an A3 size camp poster for Glipy group for Diabetes detection camp.\r\nUse the attached carb overload poster, kindly include the persn eating food in the poster and also use other elements in the poster.\r\nThe dummy PPT has been attached for your reference.\r\nAdd Date, Time and Place.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Others\",\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-16 04:58:33', '', '2026-02-16 04:58:33', '2026-02-18 13:44:11'),
(462, 41, 'Mother\'s day box AW', 'All brands of nepal ', 1, 3, 'Make me a box for the Mother\'s Day distribution for the Mother\'s Day input. \r\n\r\nThere will be a total of 5 AWs with different branding. The sizes of the boxes will be different. \r\nThe branding will be as follows:\r\n\r\nBrands\r\n1) Gestofit, Urdiogem, Lactonic granules, Richglow\r\n2) Tellzy, Tellzy AM , Rekool, Urdiogem\r\n3) Oryza cream and lotion, Oryza CeraMax\r\n4) Azithral and Laveta M\r\n5) Azithral liquid and New Livfit syrup\r\n\r\nThe box will have the Aw of a mother with a child. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-16 05:10:37', '', '2026-02-16 05:10:37', '2026-02-25 03:19:54'),
(463, 69, 'Oz Sensitive - 3 Brand Videos', 'Oryza Sensitive', 2, 11, ' 3 videos to be created -\r\n1.	Sensitive skin doesn’t have one cause - cosmetic overuse, sun exposure, topical steroid abuse, or post-sometic procedures can all trigger it. Different problems, same outcome: a weakened skin barrier that needs one gentle, dependable solution.\r\n2.	Nearly one-third of the population experiences sensitive skin, marked by redness, irritation, and discomfort. Despite its high prevalence, many still rely on trial-and-error products instead of targeted sensitive-skin care.\r\n3.	Social media-driven skincare trends push frequent product switching and ingredient overload. Influenced by reels and YouTube, people unknowingly damage their skin barrier—turning normal skin into sensitive skin.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'in_progress', '2026-02-16 05:20:30', '', '2026-02-16 05:20:30', '2026-03-22 18:31:00'),
(464, 143, 'Cloff Anthem Video', 'Cloff', 2, 10, 'Cloff Anthem Video to be  created to show in cycle meeting. The video should be motivational. The audio is been created. The anthem lyrics are in hindi language emphasizing passion. The objective of the video is to motivate team to sell more and more cloff by targeting specialties like  ENT & Pedia', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-16 05:27:41', '', '2026-02-16 05:27:41', '2026-03-09 10:55:11'),
(469, 129, 'Tellzy survey LBL', 'TELLZY', 1, 1, 'Kindly make a survey LBL of TELLZY using the below-mentioned pointers. The design, layout, font style, color theme, and overall format should remain the same as the old Survey LBL. Please do not change the structure; only update the content as per the given inputs.\r\nPlease ensure the heading includes an asterisk (*) and clearly mention “*Data on File” at the bottom of the LBL artwork. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-16 09:57:01', '', '2026-02-16 09:57:01', '2026-02-18 06:39:12'),
(471, 97, 'PSA camp Poster', 'Geripod-D', 1, 2, 'PSA camp poster A3 size Hindi language-A PSA camp poster is used to create awareness, encourage screening, and enable early detection of prostate disorders, especially in men above 50 years.\r\nImportance of prostate health\r\n\r\nSilent progression of prostate diseases\r\n\r\nNeed for regular screening after age 50\r\n The poster acts as a call-to-action to:\r\n\r\nVisit the PSA screening camp\r\n\r\nConsult a doctor\r\n\r\nTake preventive steps\r\n\r\nThis improves camp footfall and patient engagement.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Others\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-16 11:12:06', '', '2026-02-16 11:12:06', '2026-02-17 10:00:25'),
(472, 69, 'Rosacea LBL', 'Oryza Sensitive', 1, 1, 'We want to develop a premium front and back LBL for doctor tables demonstrating rosacea-related redness and our cream’s effectiveness. The front should show visible facial redness due to rosacea. When the cream is applied (conceptual demo), the redness visually fades, symbolizing soothing action. The LBL should highlight rosacea as a common indication and position our sensitive skin cream as an ideal solution for redness-prone skin, creating strong visual impact and meaningful in-clinic discussions.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-16 18:05:25', '', '2026-02-16 18:05:25', '2026-02-24 08:07:52'),
(474, 164, 'Rafle Chit Pad Designing', 'Rafle', 1, 1, 'Rafle chit pad - shall contain a pop -up of the gut where punchline to highlighted. A fold in between where the pop-up mounts, below to this Rafle branding and organizational logo.  Keep the base colour white (light colour) so that the brand name highlights well. Kindly the gut image same or better image as per the reference image', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-17 09:09:23', '', '2026-02-17 09:09:23', '2026-02-19 06:43:39'),
(475, 98, 'CETANIL VA CHANGES', 'CETANIL', 1, 1, 'PFA Opening pages for CETANIL VA\r\n\r\nAlso i have done some changes in some of the pages, Kindly design the pages accordingly.\r\n\r\nChange graphs design, need some options for triangle cardio metabolic renal.\r\n\r\nalso follow the pages sequences as per the ppt mailed. change pic of pedal edema and kidney progession\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-17 09:43:53', '', '2026-02-17 09:43:53', '2026-02-19 05:35:55'),
(476, 115, 'Milbecidal magazine advertisement artwork', 'Milbecidal', 1, 1, 'need an Milbecidal advertisement artwork in A4 size, have share the pdf of Rx pad which was made by your team, have mentioned what is to be removed and what is to be added in comments. If any query contact me\r\nMilbecidal advertisement artwork for magazine . . . . . . . . . ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\",\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-17 10:50:04', '', '2026-02-17 10:50:04', '2026-02-20 12:06:14'),
(477, 63, 'AAA Creatives', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'As discussed, we propose to sensitize the field team through teasers/flyers, encouraging them to keep their passports (for self and spouse) ready for an exciting new destination to attend AAA. Alembic Achievers Award is annual event to celebrate and felicitate field employees for achieving their annual sales targets. The event is hosted at an international destination and includes a 3-night program with sightseeing, cultural experiences, and the prestigious Award Function Ceremony.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\",\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-17 11:15:19', '', '2026-02-17 11:15:19', '2026-02-20 05:12:04'),
(478, 63, 'Women\'s Day', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'As we approach our International Women’s Day Celebration scheduled on 6th March, we request your support in designing the creatives for the same.\r\nThe theme for IWD this year is #GiveToGain, we would like our creatives to follow and reflect this narrative. \r\nOn ground - Event Invitation: \r\nDate: 6 March, Venue: Goldfinch Hotel, Andheri East Time: 4pm onwards\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-17 11:16:59', '', '2026-02-17 11:16:59', '2026-03-06 07:44:51'),
(479, 63, 'Sharpsell and Pitchwiz platform for field employees', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'This is regarding the Phase 1 Pilot of Sharpsell – PitchWiz for the 500-user group.\r\n\r\nThe narrative focuses entirely on empowering the field force. It’s positioning the app as an area to practice, fail, and improve privately so they can win more prescriptions in the clinic.\r\n•	Multi-Channel Reach: We will leverage Email, Empower, iPad, WhatsApp, and AskTara to ensure 360-degree visibility.\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'pending', '2026-02-17 11:18:56', '', '2026-02-17 11:18:56', '2026-02-17 11:18:56'),
(480, 63, 'Sharpsell and Pitchwiz platform for field employees', 'Internal Communications', 2, 10, 'This is regarding the Phase 1 Pilot of Sharpsell – PitchWiz for the 500-user group.\r\nThe narrative focuses entirely on empowering the field force. It’s positioning the app as an area to practice, fail, and improve privately so they can win more prescriptions in the clinic.\r\n•	Multi-Channel Reach: We will leverage Email, Empower, iPad, WhatsApp, and AskTara to ensure 360-degree visibility.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-02-17 11:21:06', '', '2026-02-17 11:21:06', '2026-03-23 10:40:50'),
(481, 147, 'Grogain Pro final VA all pages', 'Grogain Pro', 1, 1, 'These are the all pages of VA for Grogain pro. There are only few changes in older VA which must be available with team. If VA open files are not available please let me know I can share with you. As the changes are minimal expecting this to be completed on priority', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-18 04:58:55', '', '2026-02-18 04:58:55', '2026-02-19 06:33:25'),
(482, 69, 'Oyrza Skin Camp Logo Designing ', 'Oryza Group', 1, 4, 'We are launching an AI-based Skin Camp for the Oryza group and require a premium, modern logo. The design should reflect AI technology, dermatology expertise,  and innovation while aligning with Oryza’s brand identity. It must be clean and minimal, suitable for both print and digital use. Name is: Oryza AI Skin Camp', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\",\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-18 05:23:31', '', '2026-02-18 05:23:31', '2026-03-04 10:49:47'),
(485, 115, 'Festive flyer greetings for the month of February, March and April', 'refer the mail ', 1, 2, 'Need festive/days flyer for below mentioned days\r\n19th Feb 2026 - Shiv Jayanti\r\n3rd March 2026 - World Wildlife Day\r\n3rd March 2026 - Holi/Rang Panchami\r\n19th March 2026 - Gudi Padwa\r\n20th March 2026 - Ramzan Eid\r\n27th March 2026 - Ram Navami\r\n31st March 2026 - Mahavir Jayanti\r\n3rd April 2026 - Good Friday/Easter Sunday\r\n4th April 2026 - World Stray Animals Day\r\n14th April 2026 - Ambedkar Jayanti, Baisakhi, Bihu\r\n25th April 2026 - World Veterinary Day', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'assigned', '2026-02-18 06:36:31', '', '2026-02-18 06:36:31', '2026-02-18 10:09:53');
