(491, 115, 'Ketop LBL A4 size ', 'Ketop', 1, 1, 'Need an A4 size lbl for Ketop brand, have attached the ppt draft in the mail, do refer it\r\n\r\nNeed an A4 size lbl for Ketop brand, have attached the ppt draft in the mail, do refer it\r\n\r\nNeed an A4 size lbl for Ketop brand, have attached the ppt draft in the mail, do refer it', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-18 12:02:41', '', '2026-02-18 12:02:41', '2026-02-20 12:04:54'),
(492, 124, 'Souvenier artwork for CLOFF & DSP', 'DSP & CLOFF', 1, 1, 'Design a premium one-pager souvenir artwork for CLOFF DSP highlighting powerful cough relief with a modern, clinical yet elegant theme. Use a strong respiratory visual concept, dynamic airflow graphics, and confident typography. Incorporate brand colors, doctor-centric messaging, and IMA conference branding to reflect trust, efficacy, and leadership in cough management.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-18 12:47:17', '', '2026-02-18 12:47:17', '2026-02-19 06:31:43'),
(493, 134, 'Closal VA Page', 'Closal VA ', 1, 1, 'Triclabendazole and moxidectin oral suspension is a combined anthelmintic for livestock (sheep/cattle) that treats liver fluke (all stages) and gastrointestinal roundworms.Target Species: Primarily used for sheep, goats, and cattle.Efficacy: Highly effective against early immature, immature, and mature Fasciola hepatica (liver fluke) as well as broad-spectrum gastrointestinal nematodes.It is used for treating mixed internal parasite', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-19 04:01:39', '', '2026-02-19 04:01:39', '2026-03-09 10:29:58'),
(494, 139, 'Eyecare Doctors Gift Box', 'Resync, Veldrop & Anti-Glaucoma Portfolio', 1, 3, 'Create a premium, elegant gift box design reflecting our core brand color palette and identity. The artwork should feel sophisticated, medical, and trustworthy, aligned with our ophthalmology positioning. Incorporate subtle eye-inspired visual elements, clean typography, and minimalistic graphics. Ensure the logo is prominently highlighted with a refined finish (emboss/UV) for a premium doctor-focused appeal.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-19 05:29:37', '', '2026-02-19 05:29:37', '2026-02-24 05:23:41'),
(495, 84, 'Rosave F Survey LBL', 'Rosave F', 1, 1, 'Topic :Assessing Knowledge, Attitude, and Practices in Dyslipidaemia Management based on  Risk stratification among Indian Medical Practitioners        \r\n \r\nContent to be used for LBL:                 \r\n•The majority of HCPs (68%) reported Ezetimibe as the most commonly used drug with statin,\r\n•The majority of HCPs (77%) reported that ezetimibe is best added when LDL-C goals are not achieved despite maximally tolerated statin therapy,\r\n•The majority of HCPs (73%) prescribed the combination therapy in dyslipidemia with Type 2 diabetes mellitus (T2DM) patients\r\n•Significant LDL-C reduction after initiating rosuvastatin + ezetimibe combination  & The majority of HCPs (54%) observed significant LDL-C reduction\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-19 06:57:16', '', '2026-02-19 06:57:16', '2026-02-27 04:51:09'),
(496, 102, 'Danglers', 'Ascal gel advance & Mamal LC', 1, 7, 'Ascal gel Advance Dangler design is required in Hindi & English language. The design must be fresh and unique as this is new launch brand.\r\n\r\nMamal LC Dangler design is required in English language. The design must be fresh and unique as this is also new launch brand.. . . .', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-19 08:41:41', '', '2026-02-19 08:41:41', '2026-02-23 12:46:02'),
(497, 63, 'APL Thumbnail', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'Our 118-year story is one of progress, commitment, and trust. Now, we bring it to life.\r\nI am delighted to share our new corporate film. More than a look back, it’s a celebration of our present and future. It’s powered by you, our 18,000-strong team.\r\nIn it, you’ll see the determination and collective spirit that make our ‘circle of healing’ real. We encourage you to share it with your network. \r\nThank you for being the vital force behind our enduring legacy.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"Mobile\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-19 10:20:08', '', '2026-02-19 10:20:08', '2026-02-19 11:29:33'),
(498, 63, 'Circle of Champions Collage', 'Internal Communications', 1, 2, 'Our 118-year story is one of progress, commitment, and trust. Now, we bring it to life.\r\nI am delighted to share our new corporate film. More than a look back, it’s a celebration of our present and future. It’s powered by you, our 18,000-strong team.\r\nIn it, you’ll see the determination and collective spirit that make our ‘circle of healing’ real. We encourage you to share it with your network. \r\nThank you for being the vital force behind our enduring legacy.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\",\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-19 10:26:14', '', '2026-02-19 10:26:14', '2026-02-19 11:28:55'),
