(504, 139, 'Gujarati Language Glaucoma Awareness Standee', 'Antiglaucoma Brands', 3, 15, 'Please adapt the attached file into Gujarati language, ensuring the core message, tone, and intent remain intact. The translation should be culturally relevant, simple, and easy to understand for the target audience. Maintain professional terminology where required, especially for medical/pharma references, while keeping the overall communication clear and impactful text. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Others\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-20 07:30:33', '', '2026-02-20 07:30:33', '2026-02-26 11:36:42'),
