(506, 129, 'TELLZY MT SURVEY LBL', 'TELLZY MT', 1, 1, 'I am attaching the Word file containing the pointers for the TELLZY MT Survey LBL. Kindly follow the previous TELLZY MT Survey LBL theme while designing, including the heading, asterisk, and “Data on File.”\r\n\r\nPlease use an asterisk on both the heading and “Data on File,” as you have done in the previous LBL.\r\n\r\nKindly do the needful.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Others\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-20 10:03:36', '', '2026-02-20 10:03:36', '2026-02-24 10:05:14'),
