(510, 72, 'Tellzy LN Visual Aid 2027', 'Tellzy-LN', 1, 1, 'Please create the Tellzy LN Visual Aid for 2027. \r\nRetain all existing content from the previous version (attached)\r\n\r\nUpdate graphics and design to align with 2027 brand templates. All previous images to be changed and aligned with current VA format.\r\nEnsure balanced layout, high-resolution images, and pharma-compliant readability. Aim for a modern, immersive look while keeping text-to-graphics ratio optimal.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-20 10:34:59', '', '2026-02-20 10:34:59', '2026-03-04 11:29:43'),
(511, 167, 'Bladmir VA designing', 'Bladmir', 1, 1, 'Need redesign with good simple professional layout options , design as per the presentation prepared, any clarity please prepare on high priority, Bladmir we have more focusing on Frequent Urination with each page highlight more about brand and mascot, and for Bladmir S is mainly highlight with incontinence episodes means the Urinary leakage episodes so kindly prepare accordingly', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-20 10:55:31', '', '2026-02-20 10:55:31', '2026-03-04 10:27:50'),
(512, 64, 'Exceraft LBL 1 and 2', 'Exceraft', 1, 1, 'Kindly help in designing 2 different LBLs of Exceraft.\r\nIn the 1st page the problem statement along with the solution to be designed as per the content attached.\r\nIn the second page the indication to be changed and pointers are to be designed, keeping the latrest introduced packshot of Exceraft.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-20 11:33:09', '', '2026-02-20 11:33:09', '2026-03-02 04:26:10'),
(513, 67, 'Holi Flyer', 'Glisen SM, Glisen MF, Tellzy H , Rosave Gold ', 1, 2, 'Kindly design a flyer on occasion of Holi, The poster should have date in the format 4th March, kindly refrain from using dark colour background which will hamper the brand visibility. The poster should have the logo of Alembic in the top right corner and towards the bottom it should have all the 4 brand names i.e Glisen SM, Glisen MF, Tellzy H and Rosave Gold  and above the brand name mention the line  \"From the marketers of\". ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-20 11:47:11', '', '2026-02-20 11:47:11', '2026-02-27 04:39:28'),
