(517, 67, 'Ramzan ID Flyer', 'Glisen SM, Glisen MF, Tellzy H , Rosave Gold ', 1, 2, 'Kindly design a flyer on occasion of Ramzan Id, The poster should have date in the format 19th March, kindly refrain from using colours in background which will hamper the brand visibility. The poster should have the logo of Alembic in the top right corner and towards the bottom it should have all the 4 brand names i.e Glisen SM, Glisen MF, Tellzy H and Rosave Gold  and above the brand name mention the line  \"From the marketers of\".', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'assigned', '2026-02-20 17:02:41', '', '2026-02-20 17:02:41', '2026-02-23 13:39:47'),
(518, 97, 'VA ', 'Geripod & Geripod-D, Baldsol, Geristart & Geriflo-', 1, 1, 'The first VA page for Geripod-D should powerfully highlight how Benign Prostatic Hyperplasia (BPH) disrupts daily life in men above 55 years. The central visual should depict a 55+ Indian male looking concerned and slightly uncomfortable, subtly holding his lower abdomen to indicate urinary difficulty. Surrounding him, a clock-based infographic can illustrate key interruptions across the day — slow urine flow in the morning, frequent washroom visits at work, urgency during meetings, discomfort while traveling, disturbed evening time with family, and repeated nocturnal awakenings. A day-to-night gradient background should reinforce the message that BPH causes continuous, life-disrupting symptoms.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-21 03:32:36', '', '2026-02-21 03:32:36', '2026-03-10 05:48:40'),
(519, 168, 'Geripod-M Visual Aid', 'Geripod-M', 1, 1, 'Design a premium impactful VA aligned with Geripod-M brand colors (blue and purple). Use strong headline hierarchy, minimal clutter, and impactful infographics to highlight dual-action benefits. Incorporate subtle urology visuals, patient-centric imagery, and clear data presentation. Maintain high readability, sharp pack shot visibility, and consistent branding throughout. Use icons for symptoms (frequency, urgency, weak stream). Clean white background . Add reference as mentioned. Also, add the superscript after each point for the reference numbers. Premium, impactful, aligned with the theme “Re LIVE Life” Use the 50+ old Man image on cover page & same in all the pages.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-21 03:46:57', '', '2026-02-21 03:46:57', '2026-03-10 12:19:11'),
(520, 136, 'Dil Ki Baat Booklet', 'Tellzy CH', 1, 5, 'A5 size twenty five pager booklet for patient BP monitoring and dose adherence first four page to be designed based on patient education tips to keep heart heathy and live longer second page about the patient DIL ki profile 3rd page about patient commitment & signature to adhere to the tips to keep heart heathy and then 4 page onwards 90 days BP monitoring pages ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Others\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-22 16:11:27', '', '2026-02-22 16:11:27', '2026-03-06 03:16:03'),
(521, 72, 'Tellzy Range LBLs (April\'26)', 'Tellzy, Tellzy-AM, Tellzy-MT, Tellzy-CH, Tellzy-LN', 1, 1, 'Design of Scientific Literature for Tellzy Group (Based on 2026 Visual Aid) : Tellzy, Tellzy-AM, Tellzy-MT, Tellzy-CH, Tellzy-LN\r\n\r\nAll the contents is from Newly design VA 2026.. The orientation is in portrait with contents and visuals remains same as in new visual aid 2026.\r\n\r\nThe details will be shared in PPT', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-22 18:03:30', '', '2026-02-22 18:03:30', '2026-02-27 10:20:09'),
(522, 138, 'RUMIGEST LAUNCH GIF', 'RUMIGEST', 2, 10, 'TO MAKE LAUNCH TEASER OF RUMIGEST AS A NEW PRODUCT. NEED 10-15 SECOND GIF VIDEO. TO MAKE LAUNCH TEASER OF RUMIGEST AS A NEW PRODUCT. NEED 10-15 SECOND GIF VIDEO. TO MAKE LAUNCH TEASER OF RUMIGEST AS A NEW PRODUCT. NEED 10-15 SECOND GIF VIDEO. TO MAKE LAUNCH TEASER OF RUMIGEST AS A NEW PRODUCT. NEED 10-15 SECOND GIF VIDEO.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-23 05:26:14', '', '2026-02-23 05:26:14', '2026-03-20 05:51:56'),
(523, 129, 'HOLI E-CARD', 'TELLZY', 1, 2, '\r\n\r\nPlace the heading “Happy Holi” in bold, colorful font at the top center.\r\n\r\nAdd subtle elements like gulal splashes, water balloons, or festive patterns.\r\n\r\nInsert the Holi wish message in the center with clean and readable font.\r\n\r\nHighlight the brand names Tellzy, Tellzy AM, and Voage MS in bold at the bottom.\r\n\r\nMaintain a professional yet festive look (avoid overcrowding).\r\n\r\nKeep brand names clearly visible and well-aligned.\r\n\r\nUse high-resolution design suitable for WhatsApp and email sharing.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-23 05:28:12', '', '2026-02-23 05:28:12', '2026-02-27 04:48:09'),
(524, 64, 'Deltone LBL April\'26', 'Deltone', 1, 1, 'This is redesigning of already made Deltone LBL in which the from the brand logo 30mg and 60 mg are to be removed (from the back side of the LBL) also the imgae of the person suffering from GERD to be changed to give the LBL a new look and feel. This LBL is of size A5 front and back which will be used in printed format.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-23 05:53:15', '', '2026-02-23 05:53:15', '2026-02-26 06:34:55'),
(525, 99, 'National Science Day Greeting', 'Estrofit Bolus', 1, 2, 'Kindly Provide Greeting for National Science Day.\r\n\r\n\r\nNational Science Day is celebrated in India on February 28 each year to mark the discovery of the Raman effect by Indian physicist Sir C. V. Raman on 28 February 1928. For his discovery, Sir C.V. Raman was awarded the Nobel Prize in Physics in 1930.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-23 06:41:04', '', '2026-02-23 06:41:04', '2026-02-26 06:31:56'),
(526, 89, 'Maxis Holi Video', 'Maxis Focus Brands', 2, 10, 'This project focuses on creating an informative and  engaging video on Holi Dahan, highlighting its cultural and festive significance. The video draws a meaningful connection between the festival’s message of the victory of good over evil and the vital role of doctors in society. Just as Holi Dahan symbolizes purification, doctors represent healing, protection, and hope in our lives. Through visuals and narration, the video honors their dedication and service. The video concludes with the brand name: Maxis Focus Brands', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"iPad 9\",\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-23 06:54:19', '', '2026-02-23 06:54:19', '2026-02-25 09:43:51'),
(527, 100, 'infertility awareness poster', 'Ovigyn Q10', 1, 2, 'Kindly prepare an A3 size poster for Infertility Awareness highlighting that infertility is a medical condition, not a stigma\r\n\r\nPlease ensure the design includes an impactful headline, supportive visuals, and a positive message encouraging couples to seek medical guidance without delay.\r\n\r\nKindly share the draft for review at the earliest.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-23 07:19:55', '', '2026-02-23 07:19:55', '2026-03-04 11:11:19'),
(528, 43, 'Holi Greeting', 'oryza Range', 1, 2, 'Create a refined Holi greeting for the Oryza Range by blending the festival’s theme of purification and renewal with skin protection and resilience. Craft a minimal, elegant visual and concise emotional copy that avoids overt promotion while subtly reinforcing Oryza’s dermatological care and commitment to healthy, protected skin. Thank you.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-23 07:34:53', '', '2026-02-23 07:34:53', '2026-02-27 05:11:48'),
(529, 43, 'Holika Dahan Greeting', 'Oryza Range', 3, 16, 'Create a refined Holika Dahan greeting for the Oryza Range by blending the festival’s theme of purification and renewal with skin protection and resilience. Craft a minimal, elegant visual and concise emotional copy that avoids overt promotion while subtly reinforcing Oryza’s dermatological care and commitment to healthy, protected skin. Thank you.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-23 07:36:13', '', '2026-02-23 07:36:13', '2026-02-25 10:52:28'),
