(532, 43, 'International Women\'s Day', 'oryza Range', 3, 16, 'Create an International Women’s Day greeting for the Oryza Range that celebrates strength, confidence, and self-care. Align the message with skin health and everyday resilience, using elegant visuals and empowering copy. Keep the tone inspirational, minimal, and brand-aligned, subtly reinforcing Oryza’s commitment to supporting women’s healthy, radiant skin with care.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-23 07:39:08', '', '2026-02-23 07:39:08', '2026-02-27 06:38:10'),
(533, 43, 'International Women\'s Day Greeting', 'Oryza Range', 1, 2, 'Create an International Women’s Day greeting for the Oryza Range that celebrates strength, confidence, and self-care. Align the message with skin health and everyday resilience, using elegant visuals and empowering copy. Keep the tone inspirational, minimal, and brand-aligned, subtly reinforcing Oryza’s commitment to supporting women’s healthy, radiant skin with care.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-23 07:40:11', '', '2026-02-23 07:40:11', '2026-03-06 09:46:54'),
(534, 113, 'Freego Dose Preparation Video', 'Gastron Division', 2, 10, 'The Freego dose preparation video needs refreshed content and improved visual appeal, clearly highlighting its key advantage of lump-free solution. The demonstration should focus on easy mixing, quick dissolution and accurate dosing. Clean visuals and simple messaging will enhance doctor confidence and patient acceptance, reinforcing convenience, compliance & reliability. \r\nThank you', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'assigned', '2026-02-23 07:42:56', '', '2026-02-23 07:42:56', '2026-03-16 09:54:21'),
(535, 164, 'Holi Digital Post', 'Deltone, Exceraft, Freego, Rafle', 1, 2, 'Digital post on the festive celebration of Happy Holi. The attached ppt contains Happy holi wishes , with visuals shared in the site or can take any better . And brand of all the four brands mentioned i.e. Deltone , Exceraft , Freego (Powder / syrup / PEG) and Rafle.  ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-23 07:48:19', '', '2026-02-23 07:48:19', '2026-02-27 04:44:25'),
(536, 113, 'Freego unlock the Joy theme LBL 4, 5 & 6.', 'Freego ', 1, 1, 'Freego LBL series is designed to enhance patient comfort and compliance in constipation management. With improved palatability, convenient dosing, and patient-friendly packaging, it supports better adherence and outcomes. Freego helps patients feel lighter comfortable & confiden\r\nunlocking the joy of relief in constipation.\r\nAs per your previous LBL concept for Freego, here are similar theme based LBL ideas with different occasions, keeping the emotional connect & “Unlock the Joy”', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'medium', 'in_progress', '2026-02-23 07:54:04', '', '2026-02-23 07:54:04', '2026-03-11 18:31:00'),
(537, 43, 'Ram Navami Greeting', 'Oryza Range', 3, 16, 'Create a Ram Navami greeting for the Oryza Range that reflects purity, strength, and righteousness. Connect the festival’s values of balance and protection with skin wellness through calm visuals and graceful copy. Keep the tone respectful, minimal, and non-promotional, subtly reinforcing Oryza’s commitment to gentle, protective skincare. Thank you so Much.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-23 07:55:53', '', '2026-02-23 07:55:53', '2026-02-27 11:31:45'),
