(539, 64, 'All Brand Reminder Card', 'Deltone Exceraft Freego Rafle', 1, 1, 'This All Brand Reminder card has already been designed. Will attach the previously made reminder card for reference.. Need to replace Rafle logo. Keep the brands in front page and back page as it is. The look and feel or borders can be changed as per the designer. . ..', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-23 08:17:19', '', '2026-02-23 08:17:19', '2026-02-24 12:00:58'),
(540, 139, 'AntiGlaucoma Video Text', 'Antiglaucoma Brands', 3, 16, 'For financial year 2025-26, we had one focused brand that was Travisight, the incentives, the achievements, and performance was analysed all based on the efforts made by you through Travisight.\r\nThis years we have stepped Up, The portfolio is now in the picture, you performance will now be all based on all the brands performances. So You hold on all the portfolio brand will make you the real winner. \r\nA video or clips of a team guided by the coach the team then goes to play on the field to perform their own duties the team will  win the game. \r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-23 08:59:47', '', '2026-02-23 08:59:47', '2026-02-27 11:30:43'),
(541, 81, 'Digital flyer for Holi', 'MEGACLAV-625, MONORIN-300, PENTAB-40', 1, 2, 'HOLI wish with the branding at the bottom. highlight brands that should be visible. the flyer must looks attractive, it is shared for Whatsapp communication so  the size of the poster must be covering the complete display. share 2 option so we can choose according to our need & requirmenets   ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-23 09:49:17', '', '2026-02-23 09:49:17', '2026-02-24 04:47:50'),
(542, 148, 'Zivemp-SM Detection Camp Poster', 'Diabetes Detection Camps', 1, 2, 'This is for the brand Zivemp-SM, diabetes detection camp. Zivemp-SM Cardio-Renal-Metabolic model, obese person, with diabetes, Zivolution in Holistic Diabetes Care. This is for the brand Zivemp-SM, diabetes detection camp. Zivemp-SM Cardio-Renal-Metabolic model, obese person, with diabetes, Zivolution in Holistic Diabetes Care. This is for the brand Zivemp-SM, diabetes detection camp. Zivemp-SM Cardio-Renal-Metabolic model, obese person, with diabetes, Zivolution in Holistic Diabetes Care.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-23 10:24:35', '', '2026-02-23 10:24:35', '2026-02-24 13:24:10'),
(543, 123, 'Kodiceft & Minertox VA update ', 'Kodiceft & Minertox VA update ', 1, 1, 'Kodiceft is a new poultry product. The LBL has been developed by Reshma before. For Minertox, Nilesh has worked on it before. We are planning to update the VA for the next quarter. We will require the artwork finalized  before this month. Kindly let us know whom to connect. Thanks ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-23 10:42:16', '', '2026-02-23 10:42:16', '2026-03-10 04:59:36'),
(544, 99, 'Holika Dahan Celebration Day Greeting', 'PORON', 1, 2, 'Kindly Provide the greeting of Hoilika Dahan\r\n\r\nHolika Dahan, rendered Holika Dahanam in Sanskrit or Chotti Holi, is a Hindu festival in which a bonfire is lit to celebrate the burning of the demoness, Holika This ritual is symbolic of victory of good over evil. It precedes Holi, the festival of colours, which celebrates the spring season.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-23 10:49:12', '', '2026-02-23 10:49:12', '2026-02-26 08:40:55'),
(545, 99, 'World Wildlife Day', 'Moxel', 1, 2, 'Kindly provide greeting for World Wildlife Day\r\n\r\n\r\nDecember 2013, at its 68th session, the United Nations General Assembly, in its resolution UN 68/205, decided to proclaim 3 March, the international day of the adoption of the Convention on  \r\nDecember 2013, at its 68th session, the United Nations General Assembly, in its resolution UN 68/205, decided to proclaim 3 March, the international day of the adoption of the Convention on ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-23 10:55:58', '', '2026-02-23 10:55:58', '2026-02-25 10:42:28'),
(546, 99, 'Holi Greeting ', 'Sharkoferrol-Vet', 1, 2, 'Kindly provide a greeting for Holi\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nHoli is a major Hindu festival celebrated as the Festival of Colours, Love and Spring. It celebrates the eternal and divine love of the deities Radha and Krishna. Additionally, the day signifies the triumph of good over evil, as it commemorates the victory of Vishnu as Narasimha over Hiranyakashipu.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-02-23 10:58:12', '', '2026-02-23 10:58:12', '2026-02-25 09:37:40'),
(547, 99, 'Gudi Padwa,Ugadi, Cheti Chand, Eid ul-Fitr Greeting ', 'Ascal Gold', 1, 2, 'Kindly provide 4 Greetings \r\n\r\n\r\nDont Read This        Holi is a major Hindu festival celebrated as the Festival of Colours, Love and Spring. It celebrates the eternal and divine love of the deities Radha and Krishna. Additionally, the day signifies the triumph of good over evil, as it commemorates the victory of Vishnu as Narasimha over Hiranyakashipu.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-23 11:00:52', '', '2026-02-23 11:00:52', '2026-03-23 08:52:22'),
(548, 132, 'Aqua VA Focus Brand Updating', 'Sharkoferrol Aqua, Wasorich & Wasorich Super, Mina', 1, 1, 'I need to update Aqua Focus brand VA for the following products.  Two products need to change theme and page sequence and other three brands needs to modify the theme and texts. Moreover it is not new work it is simmply modification. \r\n\r\n1. Sharkoferrol Aqua\r\n2. Wasorich\r\n3. Wasorich Super\r\n4. Minal Forte Advanced\r\n5. Y2ALL', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-23 11:19:37', '', '2026-02-23 11:19:37', '2026-03-09 04:56:41'),
(549, 44, 'Voage S Holi Video', 'Voage S', 2, 13, 'Create a heartfelt Holi wish video for Voage S that emotionally connects with our doctors, partners, and internal team. Use vibrant colors to symbolize trust, care, and long-term partnership. Show the Voage S logo emerging creatively from flowing colors. Add a warm message appreciating doctors for adding the colors of health to patients’ lives and thanking our team for their dedication. Keep the tone premium, grateful, and inspiring.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-24 02:56:22', '', '2026-02-24 02:56:22', '2026-03-02 09:15:37'),
(550, 69, 'Women\'s day digital activity', 'Oryza Sensitive', 4, 18, 'Create a personalized digital appreciation experience for women dermatologists. The doctor enters her name and BM employee code, selects any 3 qualities from a list of 8, and uploads her photo. Upon submission, a premium downloadable word cloud is generated with her name at the center, selected qualities highlighted, all 8 qualities displayed, and her photo placed elegantly.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'in_progress', '2026-02-24 03:48:32', '', '2026-02-24 03:48:32', '2026-02-26 18:31:00'),
(571, 164, 'Rafle Visual Aid', 'Rafle', 1, 1, 'Rafle Visual Aid page designing. There are two pages on the left side there is problem situation where icons or images to be used. Followed with Rafle communication, please check the Registered mark placement for Rafle logo to be placed above between E & the triangle. Template shall be clear so visuals pop out', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-02-24 05:43:55', '', '2026-02-24 05:43:55', '2026-03-06 03:16:54'),
(572, 156, 'Availability and Doctor card', 'Reluher', 1, 2, 'I would like to design an availability card and doctor cards for my new launch product Reluher. The availability card will be used at chemist counters to ensure product visibility and stock awareness. The doctor cards will support brand recall, communication, and prescription generation during field detailing. Kindly initiate the design process accordingly.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-24 06:52:46', '', '2026-02-24 06:52:46', '2026-03-11 07:05:21'),
(573, 131, 'festive greetings', 'Sharkoferrol,Promix,Minal plus', 1, 2, 'holi - 2nd march , Gudi Padwa, Ugadi , National Poultry day - 19th March, Ramzan eid - 21st March 2026, Ram Navami- 26th March , World Water day - 22nd March 2026.  holi - 2nd march , Gudi Padwa, Ugadi , National Poultry day - 19th March, Ramzan eid - 21st March 2026, Ram Navami- 26th March , World Water day - 22nd March 2026.  ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'medium', 'assigned', '2026-02-24 06:53:18', '', '2026-02-24 06:53:18', '2026-02-24 08:07:51'),
(574, 99, 'Brand Logo', 'Alvite-M Gold  ', 1, 1, 'Kindly Provide Brand Logo For New Product Alvite-M Gold. \r\nCreat Logo in bold and bright colours. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDont Read This. Boosts Milk Production: Improves yield in dairy animals by providing essential minerals.\r\nEnhances Immunity & Growth: Strengthens the immune system in livestock and promotes better growth.\r\nImproves Reproduction: Helps prevent repeat breeding and supports reproductive performance with Zinc, Copper, and Cobalt.\r\nR', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'pending', '2026-02-24 07:01:46', '', '2026-02-24 07:01:46', '2026-02-24 07:01:46'),
(575, 134, 'Alvite M Gold Brand Name Design', 'Alvite M Gold', 1, 4, 'Vetmantra MMC, MIIN Forte, and REFIT Animal Care, are essential supplements designed to boost milk production, improve reproduction, and enhance immunity. These mixtures, often containing chelated minerals for better absorption, should typically be included in the cattle\'s daily feed at a rate of 2% of the dry matter.Macro Minerals: Calcium (Ca) and Phosphorus (P) are crucial for milk production and skeletal strength, along with Magnesium (Mg) for metabolism.\r\nTrace Minerals: Zinc (Zn), Copper (Cu), Manganese (Mn), Cobalt (Co), Iodine (I), Iron (Fe), and Selenium (Se) are vital for growth and health.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-02-24 07:59:54', '', '2026-02-24 07:59:54', '2026-03-11 04:51:14'),
(594, 120, 'AV Creation for Cardigem CBM Meeting', 'Glisen Group, Tellzy H/AH, Rosave Gold and Tufehar', 2, 10, 'AV, This AV sets the tone for FY27 with a powerful, performance-driven narrative. It captures the evolving market reality, rising competition, and the urgency to move faster than expectations. The film transitions from reflection to realization—highlighting that growth responds to pace, not pressure. Through dynamic visuals of execution, customer addition, conversion, and recognition, the AV defines what it truly means to Excelerate: excel in every call, accelerate every conversion, expand consistently, and elevate performance monthly. It culminates in a strong ownership message—shifting focus from activity to impact, from targets to results—welcoming the team to a year of disciplined acceleration', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-02-24 10:20:18', '', '2026-02-24 10:20:18', '2026-03-04 10:28:54'),
(595, 120, 'AV Creation for Cardigem CBM Meeting', 'Glisen Group, Tellzy H/AH, Rosave Gold and Tufehar', 2, 10, 'AV sets the tone for FY27 with a powerful, performance driven narrative. It captures the evolving market reality, rising competition, & the urgency to move faster than expectations.The film transitions from reflection to realization highlighting that growth responds to pace, not pressure. Through dynamic visuals of execution, customer addition, conversion, and recognition, the AV defines what it truly means to Excelerate: excel in every call, accelerate every conversion, expand consistently, and elevate performance monthly. It culminates in a strong ownership message shifting focus from activity to impact, from targets to results welcoming the team to a year of disciplined acceleration', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-24 10:22:27', '', '2026-02-24 10:22:27', '2026-03-10 10:26:28'),
(597, 120, 'AV Creation for Cardigem CBM Meeting', 'Glisen Group, Tellzy H/AH, Rosave Gold and Tufehar', 2, 10, 'AV sets the tone for FY27 with a powerful, performance driven narrative. It captures the evolving market reality, rising competition, & the urgency to move faster than expectations.The film transitions from reflection to realization highlighting that growth responds to pace, not pressure. Through dynamic visuals of execution, customer addition, conversion, and recognition, the AV defines what it truly means to Excelerate: excel in every call, accelerate every conversion, expand consistently, and elevate performance monthly. It culminates in a strong ownership message shifting focus from activity to impact, from targets to results welcoming the team to a year of disciplined acceleration', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'assigned', '2026-02-24 10:23:50', '', '2026-02-24 10:23:50', '2026-03-04 06:51:17'),
(598, 100, 'All brand reminder card', 'Ovigyn Q10', 1, 1, 'This will take approximately 10 minutes to complete. I need to add the new brand logo to the existing brand reminder card and reorganize all the brands within the same artwork layout to ensure proper alignment, visibility, and overall design consistency as per the updated branding requirement.\r\n\r\nKindly assign the artist on priority', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-24 10:39:29', '', '2026-02-24 10:39:29', '2026-02-26 11:23:05'),
(599, 120, 'Divisional Excelaration theme collaterals ', 'Glisen Group, Tellzy H/AH, Rosave Gold and Tufehar', 1, 7, 'Design all artworks aligned to the Excelerate 2027 theme, including the Entry Arc, Main Backdrop, Standees, Bag Tags, and all supporting collaterals, ensuring a consistent visual identity and high-energy performance look across every element\r\nUse a colour combination as per logo shared, use the same colour combination and develop the artworks on same  ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-02-24 11:42:00', '', '2026-02-24 11:42:00', '2026-03-06 12:30:10'),
(600, 91, 'Medal & trophy sticker', 'Focused brands', 1, 2, 'In this need design of Medal & Trophy sticker which will have Field names on the stickers, need alembic logo on that and cardigem logo as per last time artwork, there will be brand wise medal sticker and common trophy artwork with Each achiver name will be there on it', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\",\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'medium', 'assigned', '2026-02-24 14:20:32', '', '2026-02-24 14:20:32', '2026-02-26 04:26:54');
