(675, 148, 'Zivemp-SM CME Welcome Standee ', 'Zivemp-SM', 1, 7, 'Please create an elegant and impactful welcome artwork for the launch of our new brand, Zivemp-SM. The design should reflect innovation in holistic diabetes care, highlighting cardio-renal and metabolic benefits beyond glucose control. Use modern medical visuals, vibrant yet professional colors, and a premium feel to warmly welcome delegates and celebrate this significant milestone.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-03-04 06:39:27', '', '2026-03-04 06:39:27', '2026-03-09 03:31:43'),
(676, 121, 'Rosave Gold Cath Lab activity SOP  Video', 'Rosave Gold', 2, 11, 'Hi hope you are doing good. I need a video to be made from the attached data, the video will be circulated to the HCP\'s which they will further circulate to the nursing staff. Need animation and pictures  rest briefing will be given personally. thank you need your kind support. require the first cut by 13th March 2026.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"iPad 9\",\"iPad 10\",\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Others\"]}', 'medium', 'assigned', '2026-03-04 07:02:41', '', '2026-03-04 07:02:41', '2026-03-16 10:06:23'),
(677, 123, 'Annual top performer medal ', 'Poultry brands ', 1, 4, 'This is an award for the top performer FY 2025-2026. The artwork will be used for to create a metal body medal with an alembic logo lace. Please find hte attached picture to use as a reference. \r\n\r\nWe need the files in CDR and HD PDF. \r\n\r\nWe require the artwork in a week. Thank you. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-03-04 10:35:16', '', '2026-03-04 10:35:16', '2026-03-06 05:58:44'),
(678, 90, 'March Month Flyer Content', 'SPECIA DIVISION BRANDS', 3, 16, 'Hello Team,\r\n\r\nWe would like to take up this opportunity to get the Video, Images & GIF get designed from your department, for the following days:\r\n\r\n1.	3rd March – Holika Dahan\r\n2.	4th March – Holi\r\n3.	4th March – World Obesity Day\r\n4.	8th March – International Women’s Day\r\n5.	12th March – World Kidney Day\r\n6.	19th March – Gudi Padwa, Ugadi, Cheti Chand, Eid-ul-Fitr\r\n7.	27th March – Ram Navami\r\n8.	27th March – World Adherence Day\r\n9.	31st March – Mahavir Jyanti\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Others\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'accepted', '2026-03-04 10:35:19', '', '2026-03-04 10:35:19', '2026-03-04 10:37:35'),
(679, 138, 'C4ALL GIF VIDEO', 'C4ALL ', 2, 13, 'NEED C4ALL VIDEO OF BACTERIAL BIOFILM FORMATION. NEED C4ALL VIDEO OF BACTERIAL BIOFILM FORMATION. NEED C4ALL VIDEO OF BACTERIAL BIOFILM FORMATION. NEED C4ALL VIDEO OF BACTERIAL BIOFILM FORMATION. NEED C4ALL VIDEO OF BACTERIAL BIOFILM FORMATION. NEED C4ALL VIDEO OF BACTERIAL BIOFILM FORMATION. NEED C4ALL VIDEO OF BACTERIAL BIOFILM FORMATION. NEED C4ALL VIDEO OF BACTERIAL BIOFILM FORMATION. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-03-04 11:21:00', '', '2026-03-04 11:21:00', '2026-03-06 11:31:09'),
(680, 124, 'Tetan & Roxid box artwork ', 'Tetan & Roxid ', 1, 3, 'Designed with box artwork, the TETAN & ROXID box artwork reflects quality, trust, and professional excellence. The packaging highlights the product identity with a clean and impactful visual approach, ensuring strong brand recall among healthcare professionals. Presented with Best Compliments, this artwork symbolizes our commitment to effective therapy and meaningful doctor–patient care.\r\nuse one panel for artwork ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'assigned', '2026-03-04 11:44:08', '', '2026-03-04 11:44:08', '2026-03-04 13:37:25'),
(681, 143, 'Certificate for Acute Cluster', 'All Focus Brands of Acute Cluster', 1, 2, 'Certificate creation in recognition of your outstanding contribution, dedication, and valuable  contribution. n recognition of your outstanding contribution, dedication, and valuable efforts towards n recognition of your outstanding contribution, dedication, and valuable efforts towards n recognition of your outstanding contribution, dedication, and valuable efforts towards n recognition of your outstanding contribution, dedication, and valuable efforts towards', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-03-04 12:01:15', '', '2026-03-04 12:01:15', '2026-03-05 08:41:56'),
(682, 72, 'Cycle Meet (L&D) Certificate', 'Required for Field Team on L&D activities', 1, 2, 'Certificated required for Field Team on L&D activities intended to recognize the field team for their active participation during cycle meet like,\r\nPoster presentation by AM & Team, Detailing session, Quiz etc.\r\n\r\nNeed the certificate by Today EOD so that we can print the same.\r\n\r\nContact for any query...\r\n\r\nregards\r\nChandan', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-03-05 04:29:41', '', '2026-03-05 04:29:41', '2026-03-06 07:34:17'),
(683, 136, 'Hall of fame', 'SUMMIT', 1, 7, 'Design a standardized “Hall of Fame” template for the upcoming Cycle Meet across four locations. The template should highlight top performers with their name, HQ, achievement figures, and photograph, aligned with the Summit happy theme. It must be visually impactful, consistent across all venues, and suitable for stage display, backdrop, and recognition presentations.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'assigned', '2026-03-05 05:42:38', '', '2026-03-05 05:42:38', '2026-03-05 13:01:31'),
(684, 71, 'GPD- Nocturia Script', 'Geripod', 2, 11, 'Visual script for the nocturia VA  opener video. The concept relies purely on visuals without text to communicate the repeated night awakenings experienced by patients.\r\n\r\nTitle: The Night on Repeat\r\nDuration: Approximately 15 seconds\r\nApproach: Visual storytelling with natural sounds only\r\n\r\nThe repetition of night awakenings visually conveys the burden of nocturia without requiring text, making it suitable for looping in clinical presentations.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-03-05 07:01:48', '', '2026-03-05 07:01:48', '2026-03-16 03:46:26'),
(685, 159, 'YERA ARTWORK - OSTEOFIT ', 'OSTEOFIT-HD, GERIJOINT, AXOGURD, TOFALEMBIC ', 1, 3, 'Require Branding on existing artwork Require Branding on existing artwork Require Branding on existing artwork Require Branding on existing artwork Require Branding on existing artwork Require Branding on existing artwork Require Branding on existing artwork Require Branding on existing artwork Require Branding on existing artwork Require Branding on existing artwork ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-03-05 09:27:08', '', '2026-03-05 09:27:08', '2026-03-12 12:29:11'),
(686, 41, 'AP26 CYCLE MEETING POST CARD', 'All brands of nepal ', 1, 1, 'The AW will be for the postcards for Nepal\'s cycle meeting. The envelope, two postcards, an appreciation card, and a procedure card are among these postcards. To be given out at the cycle meeting, the cards must be made like postcards. Each MR\'s name, photo, and headquarters will be added to the post cards.\r\n\r\nIt will be printed as follows\r\n1. Envelope design \r\n2. Card 1 - letter on front, procedure on back\r\n3. Card 2- manifestion for professional \r\n4. Card 3- manifestation for personal', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-03-05 10:22:51', '', '2026-03-05 10:22:51', '2026-03-12 06:32:48'),
(687, 152, 'Need to add animation in VA Page', 'Ulgel', 2, 10, 'As the page opens, a wave of cooling blue energy spreads smoothly across the screen, calming the fiery red acidity visuals. The burning sensation gradually fades, transforming into a soothing, icy freshness. Within 10 seconds, the heat completely dissolves, leaving a calm, cool environment—symbolizing how Ulgel rapidly neutralizes acidity and provides fast cooling relief.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\",\"Chemists\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-03-05 10:33:24', '', '2026-03-05 10:33:24', '2026-03-23 10:16:01'),
(688, 174, 'Osteofit Division Anthem', 'Osteofit', 2, 14, 'Requirement of a divisional video which incorporates Osteofit\'s script & ideation making the field engagement high & concepts easy to grasp.\r\nRequirement of a divisional video which incorporates Osteofit\'s script & ideation making the field engagement high & concepts easy to grasp.\r\nRequirement of a divisional video which incorporates Osteofit\'s script & ideation making the field engagement high & concepts easy to grasp.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-03-05 11:15:01', '', '2026-03-05 11:15:01', '2026-03-10 11:52:21'),
