(693, 138, 'RUMIGEST STANDIEE', 'RUMIGEST', 1, 7, 'DESIGN A GOOD LAUNCH STANDIEE OF RUMIGEST. DESIGN A GOOD LAUNCH STANDIEE OF RUMIGEST. DESIGN A GOOD LAUNCH STANDIEE OF RUMIGEST. DESIGN A GOOD LAUNCH STANDIEE OF RUMIGEST. DESIGN A GOOD LAUNCH STANDIEE OF RUMIGEST. DESIGN A GOOD LAUNCH STANDIEE OF RUMIGEST. DESIGN A GOOD LAUNCH STANDIEE OF RUMIGEST. DESIGN A GOOD LAUNCH STANDIEE OF RUMIGEST. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-03-06 06:58:51', '', '2026-03-06 06:58:51', '2026-03-06 09:39:12'),
(694, 104, 'Estroplus VA', 'Estroplus ', 1, 1, 'A few medical modifications in the existing Estroplus VA page for the FY 26-27\r\nDesign remains the same, just 2 new pointers to be added \r\nTheme is also same\r\nA few medical modifications in the existing Estroplus VA page for the FY 26-27\r\nDesign remains the same, just 2 new pointers to be added \r\nTheme is also same\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-03-06 09:06:34', '', '2026-03-06 09:06:34', '2026-03-13 12:28:08'),
(695, 123, 'Annual meeting standee ', 'Poultry brands ', 1, 7, 'The artwork request is for poultry division annual meeting standees. The request is for 3 standees. \r\n                                                       * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-03-06 09:26:59', '', '2026-03-06 09:26:59', '2026-03-12 06:14:16'),
(696, 161, 'AZITHROMYCIN CONSENSUS MEETING ARTWORKS ', 'AZITHRAL OL ', 1, 1, 'Azithromycin Consensus Meetings collaterals. 1st Collateral is   A 4 pager agenda copy which contains Topic , Agenda & Photos of all Drs participating in the Meeting. Meeting is planned for 15th March . Shall require artwork by 10th  March as it requires to be printed.\r\n\r\nApart from that one pager Medical content also required. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'assigned', '2026-03-06 15:53:55', '', '2026-03-06 15:53:55', '2026-03-09 04:54:37'),
(697, 69, 'Oryza Sensitive Standee', 'Oryza Sensitive', 1, 7, 'Design a standee for use during CMEs by our field managers to enhance brand visibility and recall among dermatologists. The standee should be visually appealing, easy to notice in a conference setting, and clearly communicate the brand identity and key message. It should also be suitable for placement near the speaker area or registration desk to maximize visibility during the event.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-03-07 07:36:34', '', '2026-03-07 07:36:34', '2026-03-11 06:31:04'),
(698, 120, 'Glisen VA Animation ', 'Glisen Group', 2, 10, 'Please create simple and impactful animations for the Glisen Visual Aid pages to enhance doctor engagement during detailing. The animation should support the scientific message and make the content easier to explain.\r\nObjective \r\nTo make the Glisen VA more engaging and visually appealing while helping MRs communicate the key benefits clearly to doctors.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"iPad 9\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'assigned', '2026-03-07 09:36:14', '', '2026-03-07 09:36:14', '2026-03-12 09:39:33'),
(699, 124, 'Standee Artwork - VILDAMBIC & DSP', 'VILDAMBIC & DSP', 1, 1, 'Design an impactful standee for the EWE Meet highlighting our key brands Vildambic & DSP. The design should be professional, modern, and pharma-focused, reflecting strong diabetes care leadership. Use bold visuals, dynamic graphics, and brand colors to create a powerful presence.\r\n\r\nThe standee should emphasize:\r\n\r\nVildambic \r\n\r\nDSP\r\n\r\nTheme of innovation, trust, and better diabetes management\r\n\r\nInclude brand logos, product packs, and key messaging, ensuring the design looks premium and engaging for doctors at the event.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'critical', 'pending', '2026-03-09 04:30:49', '', '2026-03-09 04:30:49', '2026-03-09 04:30:49'),
(700, 145, 'EWE - Attendees and Speaker details ', 'Ulgeraft', 4, 29, 'This project is all about capturing details of all doctors who are going to attend EWE as attendee and speaker. \r\n\r\nWe have to develop a platform wherein we should be able to capture details of doctors like PCODE, HQ name, etc.\r\n\r\nWe can upload doctor list so that it would be easy for a MR to just select and submit ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\",\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-03-09 05:46:44', '', '2026-03-09 05:46:44', '2026-03-17 07:19:33'),
(701, 43, 'Standee for CME/RTM/GDM', 'Oryza Ceramax', 1, 7, 'Design a 6×3 feet promotional standee with a clear visual hierarchy, strong headline, and supporting product messaging. Use high-resolution images, brand colors, and readable typography suitable for distance viewing. Ensure balanced layout, proper margins, and print-ready resolution. The design should attract attention instantly and communicate the key message effectively in a clinical or promotional environment.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'low', 'completed', '2026-03-09 07:18:51', '', '2026-03-09 07:18:51', '2026-03-12 11:27:23'),
(702, 71, 'CSM-Certificate Layout', 'Bladmir/Bladmir SGeripod/Geripod D/Geripod M', 1, 2, 'For the **Achievers Certificates**, the content has been shared via email in the presentation.\r\n\r\nPlease note that we require the **same design layout for the Brand Achievement Certificates (Slide Nos. 2–6)**.\r\n\r\nWe request your support in creating the designs for the following certificates:\r\n\r\n* Overall Achievement\r\n* Brand Achievement\r\n* SOP Achievement\r\n* Productive Call Achievement\r\n* Milestone Billing Achievement\r\n* Camp Certificate\r\n\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-03-09 07:39:24', '', '2026-03-09 07:39:24', '2026-03-10 12:53:10'),
(703, 159, 'WEIGHING SCALE ARTWORK ', 'OHD AXO ', 1, 3, 'Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. Weighing scale box-artwork. ', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-03-09 09:22:31', '', '2026-03-09 09:22:31', '2026-03-10 11:04:21'),
(704, 34, 'Resync Plus Gift flyer', 'Resync Plus', 1, 2, 'Dear Doctor\r\n“Every pen writes differently…INSERT INTO `work_requests` (`id`, `user_id`, `project_name`, `brand`, `request_type_id`, `project_id`, `description`, `about_project`, `priority`, `status`, `requested_at`, `remarks`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(770, 119, 'Tufehart - Visual AId Animation', 'Tufehart', 2, 10, 'The Tufehart Visual Aid animation is designed to deliver a compelling and scientific brand story that resonates with healthcare professionals. It visually explains the burden of iron deficiency in heart failure, highlighting its impact on patient energy levels, exercise capacity, and quality of life. Through simple yet powerful graphics, the animation demonstrates how Tufehart, with ferric carboxymaltose, restores iron stores effectively. It incorporates key clinical evidence, such as improved functional outcomes and reduced hospitalizations, making the message credible. The engaging flow ensures better recall, helping doctors quickly understand the product’s value and confidently translate it into their prescribing practice.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'critical', 'assigned', '2026-03-17 10:56:28', '', '2026-03-17 10:56:28', '2026-03-18 04:48:36'),
(771, 115, 'Need PinPoint Chitpad artwork', 'Pinpoint', 1, 1, 'A chitpad showing a brand logo of Pinpoint, make it in normal chitpad size with every pages showing Pinpoint logo\r\nIt is for activity purpose\r\nA chitpad showing a brand logo of Pinpoint, make it in normal chitpad size with every pages showing Pinpoint logo\r\nIt is for activity purpose', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Desktop\",\"iPad 10\",\"iPad 9\",\"Mobile\",\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Alembic HO\",\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\"]}', 'medium', 'completed', '2026-03-17 11:08:52', '', '2026-03-17 11:08:52', '2026-03-24 04:37:58'),
(772, 69, 'Mother\'s Day Digital Frame', 'Oryza Sensitive', 1, 2, 'We want to create a digital Mother’s Day frame that allows doctors to participate by sharing a personal message of gratitude. The concept is to have a customizable frame where the doctor completes the statement “Thank You for…” by writing what he/she is thankful for, and uplaoding a photo with his/her mother.', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'medium', 'assigned', '2026-03-18 04:54:11', '', '2026-03-18 04:54:11', '2026-03-24 10:07:25'),
