(820, 67, 'Cardigem Division All Brand reminder Card', 'All brands of our division', 1, 1, 'Please refer to the previous artwork for the Cardigem Divisional Brand Reminder Card.\r\nWe need to incorporate the following updates:\r\n•	Add Glisen (Glimepiride 1/2 mg) and Glisen MF Forte 1/2 (Glimepiride 1/2 mg + Metformin 1000 mg).\r\n•	Both Glisen and Glisen MF Forte should be featured on the first page.\r\n•	The second page will remain unchanged, with all existing brands retained as is.\r\nEnsure the layout is clean and consistent with the existing design.\r\n\r\nKindly let me know in case of any query.\r\n', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Chemists\",\"Doctors\",\"Field Representatives\",\"Others\"]}', 'high', 'completed', '2026-03-23 08:15:04', '', '2026-03-23 08:15:04', '2026-03-24 10:22:18'),
(821, 132, 'Gift Sleeve artwork and sticker artwork. ', 'Sharkoferrol, Promix Y, Minal Plus', 1, 3, 'Need to prepare a sleeve design for the Glucometer box. \r\n\r\nSleeve Size: 6.5 X 4.75 X 2.75 inch in L X W X H\r\n(Brand: Sharkoferrol, Promix Y, Minal Plus & MINAL FORTE ADVANCE)\r\n\r\nSticker: 1 X 2 inches L X W\r\n(Brand: ALBPLEX, PROMIX Y)', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Print\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Doctors\"]}', 'high', 'in_progress', '2026-03-23 10:32:37', '', '2026-03-23 10:32:37', '2026-03-24 18:31:00'),
