(823, 159, 'GERISTICKERS - FORMULA 1 THEMED - DYNAMIC STICKERS ', 'GERIJOINT', 2, 13, 'Discussed the project in details with Prashant. Want to bring my brands\' supporting story to life through dynamic, flashy & vibrant whatsapp stickers to create excitement & high noise level in the field', '{\"output_devices\":[\"Mobile\",\"Desktop\"],\"target_audience\":[\"Field Representatives\",\"Alembic HO\"]}', 'high', 'assigned', '2026-03-24 08:25:39', '', '2026-03-24 08:25:39', '2026-03-25 04:37:16'),
